1
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,200
<font color="#ffffff">DOCTOR WHO THEME</font>

2
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:46,560
<font color="#ffffff">Where the devil am I?</font>

3
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,640
<font color="#ffff00">I think it's a TARDIS.</font>

4
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:53,600
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, I think it's THE TARDIS!</font>

5
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:55,240
<font color="#ffff00">In a manner of speaking.</font>

6
00:00:57,240 --> 00:00:58,520
<font color="#ffffff">Zoe?</font>

7
00:00:59,480 --> 00:01:01,360
<font color="#ffff00">Hello, Jamie!</font>

8
00:01:01,360 --> 00:01:02,520
<font color="#ffffff">Zoe!</font>

9
00:01:02,520 --> 00:01:06,280
<font color="#ffffff">Oh!</font><font color="#ffff00"> Oh, Jamie, Jamie!</font>

10
00:01:06,280 --> 00:01:08,360
<font color="#ffff00">You remember!</font><font color="#ffffff"> Of course I remember.</font>

11
00:01:08,360 --> 00:01:10,920
<font color="#ffffff">Mind you, I forgot for so long.</font>

12
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:12,440
<font color="#ffff00">Well, they made us forget,</font>

13
00:01:12,440 --> 00:01:13,800
<font color="#ffff00">the Time Lords,</font>

14
00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:15,600
<font color="#ffff00">when we left the Doctor.</font>

15
00:01:15,600 --> 00:01:17,440
<font color="#ffff00">They erased our memories.</font>

16
00:01:18,760 --> 00:01:22,080
<font color="#ffff00">But in here, it's all back.</font>

17
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:26,520
<font color="#ffff00">Every adventure, every story,</font>

18
00:01:26,520 --> 00:01:28,880
<font color="#ffff00">every single moment!</font>

19
00:01:28,880 --> 00:01:30,800
<font color="#ffffff">Aye, but how did we get here?</font>

20
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:32,320
<font color="#ffffff">And where's the Doctor?</font>

21
00:01:32,320 --> 00:01:34,040
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, he'll be out there somewhere</font>

22
00:01:34,040 --> 00:01:35,640
<font color="#ffff00">in the stars.</font>

23
00:01:35,640 --> 00:01:38,480
<font color="#ffff00">But I don't think this is for him.</font>

24
00:01:38,480 --> 00:01:41,360
<font color="#ffff00">I think this is meant for us.</font>

25
00:01:41,360 --> 00:01:42,600
<font color="#ffff00">Oh.</font>

26
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:45,800
<font color="#ffffff">I've missed him every day of my life.</font>

27
00:01:47,080 --> 00:01:48,560
<font color="#ffffff">But I didn't realise it.</font>

28
00:01:51,720 --> 00:01:55,440
<font color="#ffff00">What they did to us was</font>
<font color="#ffff00">unforgivable.</font>

29
00:01:55,440 --> 00:01:59,400
<font color="#ffff00">And I think we've been brought here</font>
<font color="#ffff00">to undo it.</font>

30
00:02:01,320 --> 00:02:03,800
<font color="#ffffff">One last gift from the Doctor.</font>

31
00:02:05,880 --> 00:02:07,960
<font color="#ffffff">I'd still be with him now if I could.</font>

32
00:02:07,960 --> 00:02:09,520
<font color="#ffffff">Try to keep up with him.</font>

33
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:11,600
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, don't you have a family?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Aye.</font>

34
00:02:11,600 --> 00:02:13,280
<font color="#ffffff">Five daughters.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Oh!</font>

35
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:16,800
<font color="#ffffff">Legs hairier than mine</font>
<font color="#ffffff">and 19 grandchildren.</font>

36
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:19,800
<font color="#ffff00">19?!</font><font color="#ffffff"> Aye, not so wee any more.</font>

37
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:21,440
<font color="#ffff00">Well, I have a son.</font>

38
00:02:21,440 --> 00:02:22,720
<font color="#ffff00">A scientist.</font>

39
00:02:22,720 --> 00:02:24,720
<font color="#ffff00">I named him James.</font>

40
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:27,560
<font color="#ffffff">A...after me?</font>

41
00:02:28,680 --> 00:02:31,560
<font color="#ffff00">I never realised before, but...</font>

42
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:35,360
<font color="#ffff00">Well, of course after you!</font><font color="#ffffff"> Oh.</font>

43
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:38,240
<font color="#ffffff">Did you marry a man from</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the space Wheel?</font>

44
00:02:38,240 --> 00:02:40,800
<font color="#ffff00">No, no. We met on Earth</font>
<font color="#ffff00">in Australia.</font>

45
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:42,680
<font color="#ffffff">Ha! I've been there.</font>

46
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:43,720
<font color="#ffffff">Got shot at.</font>

47
00:02:43,720 --> 00:02:47,520
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, we got shot at all the time.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Aye.</font>

48
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:49,040
<font color="#ffffff">But look at you.</font>

49
00:02:49,040 --> 00:02:50,240
<font color="#ffffff">Ever so noble.</font>

50
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:54,400
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, presidential robes,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">thank you very much.</font>

51
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:56,120
<font color="#ffff00">This is my third inauguration.</font>

52
00:02:56,120 --> 00:02:57,680
<font color="#ffffff">President?</font><font color="#ffff00"> Mm-hm.</font>

53
00:02:57,680 --> 00:03:00,080
<font color="#ffffff">The Doctor would be so proud.</font>

54
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:01,280
<font color="#ffff00">Isn't it funny,</font>

55
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:03,360
<font color="#ffff00">all the things he showed us,</font>

56
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:05,480
<font color="#ffff00">and taught us,</font>

57
00:03:05,480 --> 00:03:09,720
<font color="#ffff00">I've been using them every single</font>
<font color="#ffff00">day of my life</font>

58
00:03:09,720 --> 00:03:11,360
<font color="#ffff00">without realising?</font>

59
00:03:12,560 --> 00:03:14,560
<font color="#ffff00">All those experiences</font>

60
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:16,600
<font color="#ffff00">were at the back of my mind,</font>

61
00:03:16,600 --> 00:03:18,600
<font color="#ffff00">pushing me forwards.</font>

62
00:03:18,600 --> 00:03:20,280
<font color="#ffffff">Me too.</font>

63
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:24,680
<font color="#ffffff">Do you think we'll ever see</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the Doctor again?</font>

64
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:26,560
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, I'm not sure.</font>

65
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:30,320
<font color="#ffff00">But we keep him alive</font>
<font color="#ffff00">by telling our stories.</font>

66
00:03:30,320 --> 00:03:32,920
<font color="#ffffff">WHOOSHING</font>

67
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:39,720
<font color="#ffff00">Oh.</font><font color="#ffffff"> So, we tell our stories</font>
<font color="#ffffff">to each other</font>

68
00:03:39,720 --> 00:03:41,360
<font color="#ffffff">and to our families.</font>

69
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:45,160
<font color="#ffff00">Yes. Pass them down,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">generation after generation.</font>

70
00:03:45,160 --> 00:03:48,320
<font color="#ffffff">Ah, well, where do we begin?</font>

71
00:03:48,320 --> 00:03:50,360
<font color="#ffffff">And don't say Cybermen.</font>

72
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:52,240
<font color="#ffffff">I want to forget about the Cybermen.</font>

73
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:53,880
<font color="#ffffff">SHE CHUCKLES</font>

74
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:53,880
<font color="#ffff00">OK.</font>

75
00:03:53,880 --> 00:03:56,360
<font color="#ffff00">Er... The Krotons.</font>

76
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:58,760
<font color="#ffff00">No! The Quarks.</font>

77
00:03:58,760 --> 00:04:00,920
<font color="#ffffff">The Quarks, aye.</font>

78
00:04:00,920 --> 00:04:02,760
<font color="#ffffff">The wee metal beasties.</font>

79
00:04:02,760 --> 00:04:06,320
<font color="#ffffff">And didn't the TARDIS get swallowed</font>
<font color="#ffffff">by lava?</font>

80
00:04:06,320 --> 00:04:07,800
<font color="#ffff00">Yes!</font>

81
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:09,760
<font color="#ffff00">And then things got worse.</font>

82
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:13,240
<font color="#ffffff">That's right.</font>

83
00:04:13,240 --> 00:04:14,680
<font color="#ffffff">I remember now.</font>

84
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:19,760
<font color="#ffffff">THE DOCTOR: Oh, my word! Come on,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Jamie. Into the TARDIS. Quickly.</font>

85
00:04:24,840 --> 00:04:26,720
<font color="#ffff00">Isn't it beautiful?</font><font color="#00ffff"> Eh?</font>

86
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:30,440
<font color="#ffff00">The volcanic eruption.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">It's beautiful.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Beautiful?</font>

87
00:04:30,440 --> 00:04:33,720
<font color="#00ffff">A great river of molten lava</font>
<font color="#00ffff">rolling down...</font>

88
00:04:33,720 --> 00:04:36,160
<font color="#ffffff">Quiet. Oh. Oh, dear.</font>

89
00:04:36,160 --> 00:04:38,400
<font color="#00ffff">Is something wrong?</font><font color="#ffffff"> This sort</font>
<font color="#ffffff">of thing has happened before.</font>

90
00:04:38,400 --> 00:04:41,000
<font color="#ffffff">The fluid links don't seem to be</font>
<font color="#ffffff">able to take the load.</font>

91
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:43,800
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, oh!</font><font color="#ffff00"> Mercury vapour.</font>

92
00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:47,360
<font color="#00ffff">Well, we can't stay here.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">We'll be buried by that lava.</font>

93
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:49,200
<font color="#00ffff">It's nearly on us, look!</font>

94
00:04:49,200 --> 00:04:50,840
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, my word! What a wonderful sight.</font>

95
00:04:50,840 --> 00:04:52,320
<font color="#ffff00">Fantastic.</font>

96
00:04:52,320 --> 00:04:55,080
<font color="#00ffff">Listen, will you two stop gaping</font>
<font color="#00ffff">at that and get us out of here.</font>

97
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:57,000
<font color="#ffffff">Don't worry, Jamie.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">We're safe in the TARDIS.</font>

98
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:58,600
<font color="#00ffff">Are you sure?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Well...</font>

99
00:04:58,600 --> 00:05:01,480
<font color="#00ffff">Has the TARDIS ever been buried</font>
<font color="#00ffff">up to its neck in lava before?</font>

100
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:04,680
<font color="#ffffff">Well, no.</font><font color="#00ffff"> How can you be so sure</font>
<font color="#00ffff">we're going to be all right?</font>

101
00:05:06,400 --> 00:05:09,280
<font color="#ffffff">Well, perhaps the fluid links</font>
<font color="#ffffff">have cooled down by now.</font>

102
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:14,200
<font color="#ffffff">That's a bit more power.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Zoe, can you read off</font>

103
00:05:14,200 --> 00:05:16,800
<font color="#ffffff">what that meter</font>
<font color="#ffffff">is registering, please?</font>

104
00:05:18,200 --> 00:05:21,160
<font color="#ffff00">Reading 987.3...</font><font color="#ffffff"> Yes.</font>

105
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:23,600
<font color="#ffff00">.4, .5...</font><font color="#ffffff"> Oh, no.</font>

106
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:25,600
<font color="#ffff00">6...</font>

107
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:29,920
<font color="#ffff00">It's jumped to 991. It's going up</font>
<font color="#ffff00">by numerals.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Oh, no!</font>

108
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:32,840
<font color="#ffffff">If I can't pull this down,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">we'll get stuck.</font>

109
00:05:32,840 --> 00:05:35,600
<font color="#ffffff">That stupid, idiotic...</font>

110
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:38,240
<font color="#00ffff">Doctor, the lava's up to the TARDIS.</font>

111
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:40,480
<font color="#ffff00">It's reached the 1,000 danger mark,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor.</font>

112
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:43,720
<font color="#ffffff">If only I could unstick</font>
<font color="#ffffff">this stupid, idiotic...</font>

113
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:47,680
<font color="#ffffff">There we are.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Have you done it? Are we on our way?</font>

114
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:50,960
<font color="#ffffff">It's stopped the fluid links from</font>
<font color="#ffffff">vaporising. We shan't suffocate.</font>

115
00:05:50,960 --> 00:05:53,320
<font color="#00ffff">If you don't hurry up and get us</font>
<font color="#00ffff">out of here,</font>

116
00:05:53,320 --> 00:05:54,800
<font color="#00ffff">we'll be fried by that lava!</font>

117
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:57,320
<font color="#ffff00">Isn't there any way we can get away?</font>

118
00:05:57,320 --> 00:05:59,920
<font color="#ffffff">Well, there is an emergency unit,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">but...</font>

119
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:01,520
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, no, I can't possibly use that.</font>

120
00:06:01,520 --> 00:06:03,480
<font color="#ffff00">But this is an emergency.</font>

121
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:06,480
<font color="#ffffff">But it moves the TARDIS</font>
<font color="#ffffff">out of the time-space dimension,</font>

122
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:10,320
<font color="#ffffff">out of reality.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Fine.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Reality's getting too hot, anyway.</font>

123
00:06:12,320 --> 00:06:13,920
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, all right.</font>

124
00:06:17,320 --> 00:06:18,920
<font color="#ffffff">Here we are.</font>

125
00:06:18,920 --> 00:06:21,520
<font color="#ffffff">Now, then, which end was...?</font>

126
00:06:21,520 --> 00:06:23,560
<font color="#ffffff">Yes...</font>

127
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:25,880
<font color="#ffffff">No, look, I can't possibly use this.</font>

128
00:06:25,880 --> 00:06:27,280
<font color="#ffffff">We don't know what will happen.</font>

129
00:06:27,280 --> 00:06:30,280
<font color="#00ffff">Will you stop your jabbering</font>
<font color="#00ffff">and get on with it. Look!</font>

130
00:06:31,880 --> 00:06:34,080
<font color="#ffffff">METALLIC THRUMMING</font>

131
00:06:34,080 --> 00:06:39,440
<font color="#ffffff">SONIC PULSES</font>

132
00:06:54,320 --> 00:06:57,160
<font color="#00ffff">Ah. There you are.</font>

133
00:06:57,160 --> 00:07:00,160
<font color="#00ffff">We're all right.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">What was all the panic about?</font>

134
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:02,600
<font color="#ffffff">Is there any reading</font>
<font color="#ffffff">on the meter, Zoe?</font>

135
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:04,600
<font color="#ffff00">Yes, it's...</font>

136
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:07,000
<font color="#ffff00">Well, that's funny.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">There's no reading at all.</font>

137
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:10,320
<font color="#ffffff">No. None of the meters</font>
<font color="#ffffff">are registering.</font>

138
00:07:10,320 --> 00:07:11,480
<font color="#ffffff">Not one.</font>

139
00:07:11,480 --> 00:07:15,120
<font color="#00ffff">But we're safe. We're out of that</font>
<font color="#00ffff">lava stuff and we're all right here.</font>

140
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:17,160
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, possibly.</font>

141
00:07:17,160 --> 00:07:20,160
<font color="#ffffff">I'd better get working</font>
<font color="#ffffff">on the TARDIS controls right away.</font>

142
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:22,600
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor, we're not actually</font>
<font color="#ffff00">in flight, are we?</font>

143
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:24,200
<font color="#ffffff">No. Why?</font>

144
00:07:24,200 --> 00:07:26,160
<font color="#ffff00">Well, then, presumably,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">we've landed,</font>

145
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:28,600
<font color="#ffff00">so why isn't the scanner</font>
<font color="#ffff00">showing anything?</font>

146
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:31,080
<font color="#ffffff">Well, because...</font>

147
00:07:31,080 --> 00:07:34,600
<font color="#ffffff">Well, we're nowhere.</font>

148
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:36,640
<font color="#ffffff">It's as simple as that.</font>

149
00:07:37,720 --> 00:07:39,600
<font color="#ffffff">I'll be in the power room, Jamie.</font>

150
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:41,600
<font color="#00ffff">Right.</font>

151
00:07:41,600 --> 00:07:44,600
<font color="#00ffff">Hey! What does he mean,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">we're nowhere?</font>

152
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:46,880
<font color="#ffff00">I don't know.</font>

153
00:07:46,880 --> 00:07:51,280
<font color="#ffff00">I suppose he means that outside</font>
<font color="#ffff00">the TARDIS now is nothing.</font>

154
00:07:51,280 --> 00:07:52,760
<font color="#ffff00">Just nothing.</font>

155
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:58,960
<font color="#00ffff">Well, I'm away to change,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">and I suggest you do the same.</font>

156
00:07:58,960 --> 00:08:01,720
<font color="#00ffff">You look like a wee McLarty.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">A what?</font>

157
00:08:01,720 --> 00:08:05,080
<font color="#00ffff">A ragamuffin. A... Oh, never mind.</font>

158
00:08:09,080 --> 00:08:11,600
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">What's happened?</font>

159
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:16,160
<font color="#ffff00">Nothing. It's all exactly</font>
<font color="#ffff00">the same.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Good, good.</font>

160
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:18,200
<font color="#ffff00">You're worried by something,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor, what is it?</font>

161
00:08:18,200 --> 00:08:20,040
<font color="#ffffff">Me, worried? No.</font>

162
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:24,040
<font color="#ffffff">It's only the unknown</font>
<font color="#ffffff">that worries me, Zoe.</font>

163
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:27,040
<font color="#ffff00">But if there's nothing outside</font>
<font color="#ffff00">the TARDIS and we're nowhere,</font>

164
00:08:27,040 --> 00:08:29,600
<font color="#ffff00">then what is there to worry about?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I don't know.</font>

165
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:33,600
<font color="#ffffff">The emergency unit is limited</font>
<font color="#ffffff">to a certain time, simply because...</font>

166
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:36,600
<font color="#ffff00">Because it's dangerous to stay</font>
<font color="#ffff00">where we are for any longer, yes.</font>

167
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:38,200
<font color="#ffff00">But we must be safe at the moment,</font>

168
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:41,000
<font color="#ffff00">otherwise the unit</font>
<font color="#ffff00">wouldn't let us stay here, would it?</font>

169
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:44,520
<font color="#ffffff">You're interested in what's outside</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the TARDIS now, aren't you?</font>

170
00:08:44,520 --> 00:08:48,400
<font color="#ffff00">Well, curious, yes.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Zoe, listen to me.</font>

171
00:08:48,400 --> 00:08:50,480
<font color="#ffffff">If we move outside the TARDIS,</font>

172
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:54,400
<font color="#ffffff">we step into a dimension</font>
<font color="#ffffff">about which we know nothing.</font>

173
00:08:54,400 --> 00:08:55,880
<font color="#ffffff">We shall be at the mercy</font>

174
00:08:55,880 --> 00:08:59,000
<font color="#ffffff">of the forces, outside time</font>
<font color="#ffffff">and space as we know it.</font>

175
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:01,600
<font color="#ffff00">But, Doctor, I still think</font>
<font color="#ffff00">we should go out and see...</font>

176
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:04,280
<font color="#ffffff">Zoe, we must stay in the TARDIS.</font>

177
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:12,440
<font color="#ffffff">BAGPIPE MUSIC</font>

178
00:09:33,640 --> 00:09:36,000
<font color="#ffff00">He's still got his head</font>
<font color="#ffff00">stuck in that...</font>

179
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:38,960
<font color="#00ffff">Zoe, do you see that?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Do you see where we are?</font><font color="#ffff00"> What?</font>

180
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:44,280
<font color="#00ffff">Look, on the scanner. It's my home.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">It's Scotland.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Scotland?</font><font color="#00ffff"> Aye.</font>

181
00:09:44,280 --> 00:09:46,760
<font color="#00ffff">Oh! It was there.</font>

182
