<font color="#ffffff">Oh, yes, yes, yes.</font>

361
00:20:47,680 --> 00:20:50,880
<font color="#ffffff">The TARDIS is performing</font>
<font color="#ffffff">quite normally. That's odd.</font>

362
00:20:50,880 --> 00:20:55,080
<font color="#ffff00">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Well, this meter's</font>
<font color="#ffffff">dropped below 1,000.</font>

363
00:20:55,080 --> 00:20:56,560
<font color="#ffff00">Is that critical?</font>

364
00:20:56,560 --> 00:20:59,440
<font color="#ffffff">It means we're using more power</font>
<font color="#ffffff">than we're storing.</font>

365
00:20:59,440 --> 00:21:01,960
<font color="#ffffff">But don't worry. We've got an</font>
<font color="#ffffff">emergency power booster unit</font>

366
00:21:01,960 --> 00:21:04,680
<font color="#ffffff">somewhere, if I can find the switch.</font>

367
00:21:04,680 --> 00:21:07,320
<font color="#ffffff">No. Oh, dear.</font>

368
00:21:07,320 --> 00:21:08,880
<font color="#ffffff">It's here somewhere.</font>

369
00:21:13,000 --> 00:21:18,440
<font color="#ffffff">STRANGE SONIC NEIGHING</font>

370
00:21:19,760 --> 00:21:23,000
<font color="#ffffff">Ah!</font><font color="#ffff00"> Found it?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Yes.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, that's the one.</font>

371
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:25,520
<font color="#ffffff">Now, just a little bit more power.</font>

372
00:21:25,520 --> 00:21:27,680
<font color="#ffffff">Read off the meter for me,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">will you, Zoe?</font>

373
00:21:27,680 --> 00:21:30,680
<font color="#ffff00">Reading 990...</font><font color="#ffffff"> Yes.</font>

374
00:21:30,680 --> 00:21:33,240
<font color="#ffff00">1...</font><font color="#ffffff"> Good.</font><font color="#ffff00"> 2...</font><font color="#ffffff"> Fine.</font>

375
00:21:33,240 --> 00:21:34,680
<font color="#ffff00">3...</font><font color="#00ffff"> Agh!</font>

376
00:21:34,680 --> 00:21:36,680
<font color="#ffffff">Quiet, Jamie.</font>

377
00:21:36,680 --> 00:21:39,320
<font color="#00ffff">What's been happening?</font><font color="#ffff00"> 4...</font>

378
00:21:39,320 --> 00:21:41,400
<font color="#ffffff">Yeah.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Steady at 4.</font>

379
00:21:41,400 --> 00:21:44,360
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, no.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Is something wrong?</font>

380
00:21:44,360 --> 00:21:47,000
<font color="#ffff00">5.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Good.</font><font color="#ffff00"> 6...</font><font color="#ffffff"> Fine.</font>

381
00:21:47,000 --> 00:21:50,000
<font color="#ffff00">7, 8...</font><font color="#ffffff"> Let it creep up now.</font>

382
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:51,960
<font color="#ffffff">I don't want to blow</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the fluid links again.</font>

383
00:21:51,960 --> 00:21:54,680
<font color="#00ffff">Just had the most peculiar dream.</font>

384
00:21:54,680 --> 00:21:56,840
<font color="#00ffff">There was this big white horse</font>
<font color="#00ffff">with a horn</font>

385
00:21:56,840 --> 00:21:58,680
<font color="#00ffff">right in the middle of his head...</font>

386
00:21:58,680 --> 00:22:00,880
<font color="#ffff00">A unicorn?</font><font color="#00ffff"> Aye. Probably.</font>

387
00:22:00,880 --> 00:22:02,720
<font color="#00ffff">He was charging straight towards me.</font>

388
00:22:02,720 --> 00:22:05,320
<font color="#ffff00">9... 8...</font><font color="#00ffff"> Head down, ready for the</font>
<font color="#00ffff">kill. I thought any moment!</font>

389
00:22:05,320 --> 00:22:07,960
<font color="#ffff00">Really, Jamie, your imagination</font>
<font color="#ffff00">is...</font>

390
00:22:07,960 --> 00:22:09,520
<font color="#00ffff">What's the matter?</font>

391
00:22:09,520 --> 00:22:13,880
<font color="#ffff00">I don't... Jamie, look.</font>

392
00:22:13,880 --> 00:22:16,480
<font color="#00ffff">Doctor?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Mm.</font><font color="#00ffff"> What's up?</font>

393
00:22:16,480 --> 00:22:18,360
<font color="#ffffff">Quiet, Jamie. Quiet.</font>

394
00:22:18,360 --> 00:22:21,080
<font color="#ffffff">VIBRATING THROB</font>

395
00:22:21,080 --> 00:22:23,280
<font color="#ffffff">That sound.</font>

396
00:22:23,280 --> 00:22:26,960
<font color="#ffffff">That vibration. It's alien.</font>

397
00:22:26,960 --> 00:22:30,920
<font color="#ffff00">I can feel it too. In my head.</font>

398
00:22:30,920 --> 00:22:32,880
<font color="#ffffff">I can't seem to be able</font>
<font color="#ffffff">to concentrate.</font>

399
00:22:32,880 --> 00:22:36,440
<font color="#ffffff">Concentrate, both of you.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Concentrate on something.</font>

400
00:22:36,440 --> 00:22:40,760
<font color="#ffff00">I can't!</font><font color="#00ffff"> What is it?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Read out</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the figures to me, Zoe, aloud.</font>

401
00:22:40,760 --> 00:22:42,520
<font color="#ffff00">9, 9, 1...</font>

402
00:22:42,520 --> 00:22:44,320
<font color="#ffffff">Louder. Both of you,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">read them off.</font>

403
00:22:44,320 --> 00:22:47,240
<font color="#ffff00">2, 3...</font>
<font color="#ffffff">It's getting stronger. It's...</font>

404
00:22:47,240 --> 00:22:50,200
<font color="#ffff00">3. 4...</font>
<font color="#ffffff">It's dragging me.</font>

405
00:22:50,200 --> 00:22:52,640
<font color="#ffffff">Concentrate. Both of you.</font>

406
00:22:52,640 --> 00:22:55,680
<font color="#ffff00">5...</font><font color="#ffffff"> It's too strong.</font>

407
00:22:55,680 --> 00:22:57,680
<font color="#ffffff">It's too powerful.</font><font color="#ffff00"> 6...</font>

408
00:22:57,680 --> 00:23:01,440
<font color="#ffff00">7...</font><font color="#ffffff"> It's too powerful.</font>

409
00:23:02,440 --> 00:23:05,680
<font color="#ffffff">I must fight... I must fight...</font>

410
00:23:05,680 --> 00:23:07,480
<font color="#ffffff">I will fight!</font>

411
00:23:47,800 --> 00:23:49,640
<font color="#ffff00">Jamie, the Doctor.</font>

412
00:23:49,640 --> 00:23:52,240
<font color="#ffffff">SHE SCREAMS</font>

413
00:24:18,560 --> 00:24:20,000
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor?</font>

414
00:24:21,320 --> 00:24:22,360
<font color="#ffff00">Zoe.</font>

415
00:24:24,120 --> 00:24:25,720
<font color="#ffff00">What's happened?</font>

416
00:24:25,720 --> 00:24:29,600
<font color="#00ffff">Jamie! Jamie, over here!</font>

417
00:24:29,600 --> 00:24:32,720
<font color="#ffff00">Zoe? Is that you?</font>

418
00:24:32,720 --> 00:24:36,600
<font color="#ffffff">HUSHED:</font><font color="#ffff00"> Redcoats.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Am I back in my own time?</font>

419
00:24:36,600 --> 00:24:38,520
<font color="#ffff00">If I am, they'll shoot me down.</font>

420
00:24:39,600 --> 00:24:41,680
<font color="#ffff00">Shoot me down like a dog, would you?</font>

421
00:24:41,680 --> 00:24:44,440
<font color="#ffff00">Well, a McCrimmon never died</font>
<font color="#ffff00">without a fight yet.</font>

422
00:24:44,440 --> 00:24:46,600
<font color="#ffff00">Creag an tuire!</font>

423
00:24:46,600 --> 00:24:49,360
<font color="#00ffff">Jamie? Jamie!</font>

424
00:24:52,280 --> 00:24:54,440
<font color="#00ffff">Jamie, I'm here.</font>

425
00:24:54,440 --> 00:24:56,920
<font color="#00ffff">Where are you?</font>

426
00:24:56,920 --> 00:25:00,040
<font color="#00ffff">Jamie, can you hear me?</font>

427
00:25:00,040 --> 00:25:01,160
<font color="#00ffff">Jamie...</font>

428
00:25:10,560 --> 00:25:14,880
<font color="#00ffff">Jamie, Doctor, help.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Somebody help me. I'm trapped.</font>

429
00:25:14,880 --> 00:25:18,040
<font color="#ffffff">DOOR CREAKS LOUDLY</font>

430
00:25:31,120 --> 00:25:34,160
<font color="#ffffff">SHE SCREAMS</font>

431
00:25:42,440 --> 00:25:46,080
<font color="#00ff00">Good. Good. Excellent.</font>

432
00:25:46,080 --> 00:25:50,360
<font color="#00ff00">And now the good Doctor,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">where is he?</font>

433
00:25:54,400 --> 00:25:58,760
<font color="#ffffff">ROBOTICALLY:</font><font color="#00ff00"> Look around.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">He must be here somewhere.</font>

434
00:25:58,760 --> 00:26:01,920
<font color="#00ff00">Find him. Search.</font>

435
00:26:01,920 --> 00:26:06,160
<font color="#ffffff">RELAXED:</font><font color="#00ff00"> I see. He has eluded us for</font>
<font color="#00ff00">the moment.</font>

436
00:26:06,160 --> 00:26:11,600
<font color="#00ff00">So he is not yet</font>
<font color="#00ff00">completely under my control.</font>

437
00:26:11,600 --> 00:26:16,240
<font color="#00ff00">Perhaps it is better this way.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Yes.</font>

438
00:26:16,240 --> 00:26:18,280
<font color="#00ff00">He'll soon find out.</font>

439
00:26:23,080 --> 00:26:27,600
<font color="#00ff00">Find him. Search all areas!</font>

440
00:26:27,600 --> 00:26:30,120
<font color="#ffffff">Jamie, Zoe... Jamie...</font>

441
00:26:30,120 --> 00:26:32,920
<font color="#ffffff">Fight... I must fight.</font>

442
00:26:32,920 --> 00:26:34,960
<font color="#ffffff">I must fight, fight!</font>

443
00:26:45,840 --> 00:26:48,880
<font color="#ffffff">Where in time and space am I?</font>

444
00:26:50,440 --> 00:26:52,600
<font color="#ffffff">Where are the others?</font>

445
00:26:52,600 --> 00:26:55,560
<font color="#ffffff">Jamie? Zoe?</font>

446
00:26:55,560 --> 00:26:59,160
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor. Hello!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Jamie, is that you?</font>

447
00:26:59,160 --> 00:27:01,840
<font color="#00ffff">Jamie! Doctor!</font>

448
00:27:01,840 --> 00:27:03,440
<font color="#ffffff">Zoe?</font>

449
00:27:03,440 --> 00:27:07,320
<font color="#00ffff">Doctor, I'm trapped! Help me,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">please!</font>

450
00:27:07,320 --> 00:27:12,520
<font color="#ffffff">All right, Zoe. Stay where you are</font>
<font color="#ffffff">and I'll see if I can find you.</font>

451
00:27:13,880 --> 00:27:15,400
<font color="#ffffff">Hello?</font>

452
00:27:17,560 --> 00:27:19,200
<font color="#ffffff">Call out to me.</font>

453
00:27:19,200 --> 00:27:22,200
<font color="#ffff00">Here! Over here!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, all right, Jamie.</font>

454
00:27:22,200 --> 00:27:25,120
<font color="#00ffff">Hello, Doctor! I'm over here.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">All right, Zoe.</font>

455
00:27:25,120 --> 00:27:28,200
<font color="#ffffff">OVERLAPPING SHOUTS</font>

456
00:27:28,200 --> 00:27:30,800
<font color="#ffffff">No, no, no!</font>

457
00:27:30,800 --> 00:27:33,840
<font color="#ffffff">Not both together. One at a time.</font>

458
00:27:33,840 --> 00:27:37,840
<font color="#ffffff">Now, then, Jamie,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">you seem to be the nearer.</font>

459
00:27:37,840 --> 00:27:40,560
<font color="#ffffff">You first. Count up to ten.</font>

460
00:27:40,560 --> 00:27:43,920
<font color="#ffff00">One, two, three, four...</font>

461
00:27:45,160 --> 00:27:48,640
<font color="#00ff00">Find him. Search. Search!</font>

462
00:27:49,720 --> 00:27:53,000
<font color="#00ff00">Perhaps some light will help.</font>

463
00:27:53,000 --> 00:27:55,800
<font color="#ffffff">This is like exploring a maze in the</font>
<font color="#ffffff">dark.</font>

464
00:28:04,560 --> 00:28:07,440
<font color="#ffffff">Well, thank you, whoever you are.</font>

465
00:28:07,440 --> 00:28:11,520
<font color="#ffffff">HEAVY MARCHING</font>

466
00:28:32,960 --> 00:28:36,920
<font color="#00ff00">Spread out. Cover the whole area,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">slowly.</font>

467
00:28:36,920 --> 00:28:39,960
<font color="#00ff00">Keep moving. Look left to right.</font>

468
00:28:39,960 --> 00:28:42,200
<font color="#00ff00">Search every inch of the forest.</font>

469
00:28:42,200 --> 00:28:45,880
<font color="#00ff00">We know the Doctor is here</font>
<font color="#00ff00">somewhere.</font>

470
00:28:45,880 --> 00:28:50,720
<font color="#00ff00">Hm. No sign of him,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">but he can't be far away.</font>

471
00:28:50,720 --> 00:28:54,040
<font color="#00ff00">We'll continue on this course.</font>

472
00:28:54,040 --> 00:28:58,480
<font color="#00ff00">Track him down! Those are your</font>
<font color="#00ff00">orders! He must be found!</font>

473
00:29:12,440 --> 00:29:14,880
<font color="#ffffff">HUSHED: Jamie. Zoe.</font>

474
00:29:14,880 --> 00:29:16,800
<font color="#ffffff">MAN:</font><font color="#ffff00"> Heckinah degul.</font>

475
00:29:18,200 --> 00:29:19,680
<font color="#ffff00">Tolgo fonac.</font>

476
00:29:21,800 --> 00:29:23,480
<font color="#ffff00">Langro dehul san?</font>

477
00:29:24,560 --> 00:29:27,160
<font color="#ffff00">Grildig? Splacknuck?</font>

478
00:29:27,160 --> 00:29:29,480
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, er... Parlez-vous francais?</font>

479
00:29:29,480 --> 00:29:33,800
<font color="#ffff00">Recalsitrat undique tutis!</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Glandack daytan!</font>

480
00:29:33,800 --> 00:29:36,640
<font color="#ffffff">Do you speak English, by any chance?</font>

481
00:29:36,640 --> 00:29:42,520
<font color="#ffff00">Sir, my birth was of honest parents</font>
<font color="#ffff00">in an island called England.</font>

482
00:29:42,520 --> 00:29:45,520
<font color="#ffffff">Good gracious me.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Why didn't you say so at once?</font>

483
00:29:45,520 --> 00:29:48,520
<font color="#ffff00">I've spoken as many languages</font>
<font color="#ffff00">as I have the least smattering of.</font>

484
00:29:48,520 --> 00:29:50,200
<font color="#ffff00">High and Low Dutch. Latin.</font>

485
00:29:50,200 --> 00:29:53,640
<font color="#ffffff">Well, let's start at the beginning</font>
<font color="#ffffff">again, shall we?</font>

486
00:29:53,640 --> 00:29:55,240
<font color="#ffffff">What did you say to me?</font>

487
00:29:55,240 --> 00:29:58,280
<font color="#ffff00">I said, "Beware, false traitor,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">highwayman,</font>

488
00:29:58,280 --> 00:30:00,360
<font color="#ffff00">"robber, pickpocket, murderer."</font>

489
00:30:00,360 --> 00:30:04,000
<font color="#ffffff">You must be making some mistake.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Highwayman, indeed.</font>

490
00:30:04,000 --> 00:30:06,120
<font color="#ffffff">When were you last in England?</font>

491
00:30:06,120 --> 00:30:10,800
<font color="#ffff00">We set sail from Bristol</font>
<font color="#ffff00">on May 4th 1699.</font>

492
00:30:10,800 --> 00:30:16,080
<font color="#ffffff">We?</font><font color="#ffff00"> What became of my companions</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I cannot tell. They were all lost.</font>

493
00:30:16,080 --> 00:30:19,360
<font color="#ffffff">My dear sir,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">you and I are in the same boat.</font>

494
00:30:19,360 --> 00:30:22,840
<font color="#ffff00">You have a stout ship?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Unfortunately, no.</font>

495
00:30:22,840 --> 00:30:26,480
<font color="#ffffff">Would you take that pop gun away?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">It does unsettle me so.</font>

496
00:30:26,480 --> 00:30:30,000
<font color="#ffff00">Well, sir, if you can assure me</font>
<font color="#ffff00">you are no traitor.</font>

497
00:30:30,000 --> 00:30:34,400
<font color="#ffffff">How can I be a traitor</font>
<font color="#ffffff">when I don't even know where I am?</font>

498
00:30:34,400 --> 00:30:35,960
<font color="#ffffff">Where am I?</font>

499
00:30:35,960 --> 00:30:38,120
<font color="#ffff00">I cannot tell.</font>

500
00:30:38,120 --> 00:30:41,320
<font color="#ffffff">That makes two of us, doesn't it?</font>

501
00:30:41,320 --> 00:30:44,920
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, thank you. Oh, thank you.</font>

502
00:30:44,920 --> 00:30:48,360
<font color="#ffffff">Listen, I've lost my companions,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">too.</font>

503
00:30:48,360 --> 00:30:51,120
<font color="#ffffff">Two of them, a boy and a girl. Jamie</font>
<font color="#ffffff">and Zoe.</font>

504
00:30:51,120 --> 00:30:53,920
<font color="#ffffff">Have you seen them?</font><font color="#ffff00"> Alas, no.</font>

505
00:30:53,920 --> 00:30:56,280
<font color="#ffffff">I've got to find them.</font>

506
00:30:56,280 --> 00:30:58,960
<font color="#ffffff">Perhaps you could help me</font>
<font color="#ffffff">if you know your way around.</font>

507
00:30:58,960 --> 00:31:01,720
<font color="#ffff00">It is not permitted.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Who says so?</font>

508
00:31:01,720 --> 00:31:04,120
<font color="#ffff00">The Master.</font><font color="#ffffff"> The Master?</font>

509
00:31:04,120 --> 00:31:07,000
<font color="#ffff00">He has articles of impeachment</font>
<font color="#ffff00">against you</font>

510
00:31:07,000 --> 00:31:09,520
<font color="#ffff00">for treason and other capital</font>
<font color="#ffff00">crimes.</font>

511
00:31:09,520 --> 00:31:11,560
<font color="#ffffff">Treason again? Really?</font>

512
00:31:11,560 --> 00:31:14,280
<font color="#ffff00">I leave to your prudence</font>
<font color="#ffff00">what measures you will take,</font>

513
00:31:14,280 --> 00:31:16,720
<font color="#ffff00">and now, sir, to avoid suspicion...</font>

514
00:31:18,360 --> 00:31:21,840
<font color="#ffff00">..I must retire</font>
<font color="#ffff00">in as private a manner as I came.</font>

515
00:31:23,000 --> 00:31:25,600
<font color="#ffffff">But, sir, don't go. I wanted to ask</font>
<font color="#ffffff">you...</font>

516
00:31:30,680 --> 00:31:32,600
<font color="#ffffff">A hallucination?</font>

517
00:31:34,520 --> 00:31:35,560
<font color="#ffffff">Ah, well.</font>

518
00:31:37,600 --> 00:31:38,640
<font color="#ffffff">Jamie!</font>

519
00:31:40,000 --> 00:31:41,480
<font color="#ffffff">Zoe!</font>

520
00:31:41,480 --> 00:31:43,640
<font color="#ffffff">WOMAN:</font><font color="#00ffff"> Cooee.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Is that you, Zoe?</font>

521
00:31:43,640 --> 00:31:46,000
<font color="#00ffff">Cooee.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Who's that? Who are you?</font>

522
00:31:48,440 --> 00:31:51,400
<font color="#ffffff">Well... Well, well, well, well,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">well!</font>

523
00:31:51,400 --> 00:31:52,720
<font color="#ffffff">How do you do?</font>

524
00:31:54,640 --> 00:31:59,000
<font color="#00ffff">Why did the chicken cross the road?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">This isn't the time for riddles.</font>

525
00:31:59,000 --> 00:32:02,480
<font color="#00ff00">You must answer.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Why did the chicken cross the road?</font>

526
00:32:02,480 --> 00:32:04,360
<font color="#ffffff">Very well. To get to the other side.</font>

527
00:32:04,360 --> 00:32:07,240
<font color="#ffffff">Or so I've always been led to</font>
<font color="#ffffff">believe. Now would you mind telling</font>
<font color="#ffffff">me...</font>

528
00:32:07,240 --> 00:32:10,640
<font color="#00ffff">Which is it, the yolk of an egg</font>
<font color="#00ffff">is white or the yolk of an egg are</font>
<font color="#00ffff">white?</font>

529
00:32:10,640 --> 00:32:14,440
<font color="#ffffff">Neither. It's yellow.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">How many beans make five?</font><font color="#00ffff"> Where was</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Moses when the lights went out?</font>

530
00:32:14,440 --> 00:32:16,880
<font color="#00ff00">Adam and Eve and Pinch Me</font>
<font color="#00ff00">went to the river to bathe.</font>

531
00:32:16,880 --> 00:32:20,200
<font color="#ffffff">ALL: Adam and Eve got drowned.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Who do you think was saved?</font>

532
00:32:20,200 --> 00:32:21,480
<font color="#ffffff">Well, Pinch Me, obviously.</font>

533
00:32:21,480 --> 00:32:24,160
<font color="#ffffff">THEY GIGGLE</font>

534
00:32:21,480 --> 00:32:24,160
<font color="#ffffff">Stop it. Don't do that.</font>

535
00:32:25,920 --> 00:32:29,040
<font color="#ffffff">Now it's my turn to ask you</font>
<font color="#ffffff">questions.</font>

536
00:32:29,040 --> 00:32:31,680
<font color="#00ffff">What can you make of a sword?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Huh?</font>

