<font color="#ffffff">Locked, of course.</font>

557
00:33:37,640 --> 00:33:39,400
<font color="#ffffff">And a wishing well.</font>

558
00:33:40,760 --> 00:33:42,680
<font color="#ffffff">I wish...</font>

559
00:33:42,680 --> 00:33:45,120
<font color="#ffffff">I wish I believed in wishing wells.</font>

