00:33:47,680 --> 00:33:50,120
<font color="#ffffff">MAN:</font><font color="#00ffff"> Ha! Ha! Ha!</font>

562
00:33:59,160 --> 00:34:01,200
<font color="#ffffff">Hello.</font>

563
00:34:02,280 --> 00:34:05,400
<font color="#ffffff">This is a puzzle. That's what it is.</font>

564
00:34:10,280 --> 00:34:12,440
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, yes.</font>

565
00:34:12,440 --> 00:34:16,680
<font color="#ffffff">I'm beginning to recognise this.</font>
