577
00:34:51,240 --> 00:34:54,320
<font color="#ffffff">Very well. Now, then.</font>

578
00:34:54,320 --> 00:34:57,440
<font color="#ffffff">Yes. There we are.</font>

579
00:35:00,880 --> 00:35:04,040
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, that's his nose all right.</font>

