584
00:35:18,200 --> 00:35:20,160
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, I'm glad to see you again!</font>

585
00:35:21,360 --> 00:35:23,880
<font color="#ffffff">But you're not Jamie.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Eh?</font>

