597
00:35:58,320 --> 00:36:00,240
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">He was charging straight for me,</font>

598
00:36:00,240 --> 00:36:01,680
<font color="#ffff00">head down, ready for the kill,</font>

