612
00:36:43,400 --> 00:36:45,720
<font color="#ffffff">Don't you see?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">It's not a door at all.</font>

613
00:36:45,720 --> 00:36:48,040
<font color="#ffffff">It's a brick wall</font>
<font color="#ffffff">with a door painted on it.</font>

