671
00:39:51,760 --> 00:39:54,000
<font color="#ffffff">Delighted to meet you again, sir.</font>

672
00:39:54,000 --> 00:39:56,560
<font color="#ffffff">Allow me to present my two</font>
<font color="#ffffff">companions.</font>

