696
00:41:01,120 --> 00:41:03,960
<font color="#00ff00">The best expedient</font>
<font color="#00ff00">I could think on was to keep guard.</font>

697
00:41:03,960 --> 00:41:06,520
<font color="#00ffff">Whatever you do, don't give us away.</font>

698
00:41:22,560 --> 00:41:24,440
<font color="#00ff00">I could not forbear smiling, sir.</font>

699
00:41:24,440 --> 00:41:27,640
<font color="#00ff00">What you told me is mistaken.</font>
