700
00:41:36,000 --> 00:41:38,520
<font color="#ffffff">MASTER:</font><font color="#00ff00"> At last. Very well.</font>

701
00:41:38,520 --> 00:41:41,480
<font color="#ffffff">HARSH:</font><font color="#00ff00"> Round them up and lead them</font>
