<font color="#00ff00">Now, sir, I must forbear to trouble</font>
<font color="#00ff00">you further.</font>

709
00:42:00,400 --> 00:42:03,440
<font color="#00ff00">Having answered the only</font>
<font color="#00ff00">objection you've raised against me,</font>

