<font color="#00ff00">but saw no sign of any inhabitants.</font>

889
00:53:31,800 --> 00:53:33,360
<font color="#00ffff">Are you absolutely positive?</font>

890
00:53:33,360 --> 00:53:35,800
<font color="#00ff00">I would not impose</font>
<font color="#00ff00">any falsities upon you.</font>

891
00:53:35,800 --> 00:53:38,680
<font color="#00ff00">I adhere strictly to truth.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Of course.</font>

892
00:53:38,680 --> 00:53:44,160
<font color="#ffffff">This...this person who controls</font>
<font color="#ffffff">this place...</font>

893
00:53:44,160 --> 00:53:46,920
<font color="#ffffff">The Master?</font><font color="#00ff00"> The Master. Yes.</font>

894
00:53:46,920 --> 00:53:48,720
<font color="#ffffff">Have you seen him?</font>

895
00:53:48,720 --> 00:53:52,160
<font color="#00ff00">Upon occasion he has been pleased</font>
<font color="#00ff00">to grant me an audience.</font>

896
00:53:52,160 --> 00:53:54,560
<font color="#ffffff">Where might I find him?</font>

897
00:53:54,560 --> 00:53:58,880
<font color="#00ff00">The Master's palace is</font>
<font color="#00ff00">no ordinary edifice but a citadel,</font>

898
00:53:58,880 --> 00:54:01,440
<font color="#00ff00">a walled town</font>
<font color="#00ff00">at the top of a hill or cliff,</font>

899
00:54:01,440 --> 00:54:03,240
<font color="#00ff00">which is reckoned the highest</font>
<font color="#00ff00">in the kingdom.</font>

900
00:54:03,240 --> 00:54:05,200
<font color="#ffffff">Yes. Now I think I understand.</font>

901
00:54:05,200 --> 00:54:08,280
<font color="#ffffff">May I ask, sir, where you come from?</font>

902
00:54:08,280 --> 00:54:10,160
<font color="#ffffff">Would it not be Nottingham?</font>

903
00:54:10,160 --> 00:54:12,720
<font color="#00ff00">My father had a small estate</font>
<font color="#00ff00">in Nottingham, sir.</font>

904
00:54:12,720 --> 00:54:15,200
<font color="#00ff00">I was the third of five sons.</font>

905
00:54:15,200 --> 00:54:18,280
<font color="#00ff00">He sent me to Emmanuel College</font>
<font color="#00ff00">in Cambridge at 14 years old,</font>

906
00:54:18,280 --> 00:54:20,360
<font color="#00ff00">where I applied myself</font>
<font color="#00ff00">close to my studies,</font>

907
00:54:20,360 --> 00:54:23,200
<font color="#00ff00">learning navigation and other parts</font>
<font color="#00ff00">of the mathematics...</font>

908
00:54:23,200 --> 00:54:25,440
<font color="#ffffff">"Useful for those who intend</font>
<font color="#ffffff">to travel..."</font>

909
00:54:25,440 --> 00:54:28,320
<font color="#ffffff">IN UNISON:</font><font color="#ffff00"> ..as I always believed</font>
<font color="#ffff00">it would be, some time or other,</font>

910
00:54:28,320 --> 00:54:29,600
<font color="#ffff00">my fortune to do.</font>

911
00:54:29,600 --> 00:54:31,120
<font color="#ffffff">Now I know who you are, sir!</font>

912
00:54:31,120 --> 00:54:34,320
<font color="#ffffff">Your name is Lemuel Gulliver.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Your servant, sir.</font>

913
00:54:34,320 --> 00:54:36,400
<font color="#00ffff">Gulliver?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Yes, yes.</font>

914
00:54:36,400 --> 00:54:39,400
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, I'm looking forward to a long</font>
<font color="#ffffff">talk with you one of these days.</font>

915
00:54:39,400 --> 00:54:41,720
<font color="#00ff00">I should like that above all things,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">but...</font>

916
00:54:41,720 --> 00:54:44,680
<font color="#00ff00">..it would not be proper</font>
<font color="#00ff00">at this juncture to trouble you</font>

917
00:54:44,680 --> 00:54:46,480
<font color="#00ff00">with the particulars</font>
<font color="#00ff00">of my adventures.</font>

918
00:54:46,480 --> 00:54:49,120
<font color="#ffffff">I wouldn't dream of detaining you.</font>

919
00:54:49,120 --> 00:54:51,480
<font color="#00ff00">Having been condemned by nature</font>
<font color="#00ff00">and fortune</font>

920
00:54:51,480 --> 00:54:53,880
<font color="#00ff00">to a restless and active life,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">I must take my leave of you.</font>

921
00:54:53,880 --> 00:54:57,280
<font color="#00ff00">Farewell.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Farewell.</font>

922
00:54:57,280 --> 00:55:00,280
<font color="#00ffff">Why does he talk</font>
<font color="#00ffff">in such an extraordinary way?</font>

923
00:55:00,280 --> 00:55:04,000
<font color="#ffffff">He can only speak the words</font>
<font color="#ffffff">that Dean Swift gave him to say.</font>

924
00:55:04,000 --> 00:55:07,600
<font color="#00ffff">But that's ridiculous. I mean, there</font>
<font color="#00ffff">never was such a person as Gulliver.</font>

925
00:55:07,600 --> 00:55:09,080
<font color="#00ffff">He's a fictional character.</font>

926
00:55:09,080 --> 00:55:11,000
<font color="#ffffff">Of course he is.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Don't you understand?</font>

927
00:55:11,000 --> 00:55:15,080
<font color="#ffffff">This world that we've tumbled into</font>
<font color="#ffffff">is a world of fiction -</font>

928
00:55:15,080 --> 00:55:19,680
<font color="#ffffff">unicorns, Minotaurs,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Gulliver's Travels.</font>

929
00:55:19,680 --> 00:55:21,680
<font color="#ffffff">They're all alive here.</font>

930
00:55:21,680 --> 00:55:23,720
<font color="#00ffff">Then what are WE doing here?</font>

931
00:55:23,720 --> 00:55:26,880
<font color="#00ffff">What do they want with us?</font>

932
00:55:26,880 --> 00:55:29,160
<font color="#ffffff">I'm not sure I understand that yet.</font>

933
00:55:30,200 --> 00:55:33,440
<font color="#ffffff">Come along. Let's find Jamie.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">You'd better put this on.</font>

934
00:55:37,800 --> 00:55:39,920
<font color="#ffffff">BIRDSONG</font>

935
00:55:41,560 --> 00:55:44,720
<font color="#ffffff">RHYTHMIC CREAKING</font>

936
00:55:51,680 --> 00:55:54,200
<font color="#ffffff">METALLIC SCRAPING</font>

937
00:56:03,840 --> 00:56:07,080
<font color="#ffffff">RHYTHMIC CREAKING CONTINUES</font>

938
00:56:14,880 --> 00:56:16,640
<font color="#ffffff">CREAKING STOPS</font>

939
00:56:34,000 --> 00:56:35,960
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, no.</font>

940
00:56:35,960 --> 00:56:39,480
<font color="#ffff00">I'd need to be a human fly</font>
<font color="#ffff00">to get up that lot.</font>

941
00:56:39,480 --> 00:56:42,840
<font color="#ffff00">I can't go back, though.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">What I really need is a...</font>

942
00:56:47,520 --> 00:56:49,760
<font color="#ffff00">Who says wishes don't come true?</font>

943
00:56:54,000 --> 00:56:57,920
<font color="#ffffff">RHYTHMIC CREAKING</font>

944
00:57:16,640 --> 00:57:18,680
<font color="#ffff00">So far, so good.</font>

945
00:57:18,680 --> 00:57:20,720
<font color="#ffff00">Some sort of castle.</font>

946
00:57:20,720 --> 00:57:23,040
<font color="#ffff00">Well, Jamie, now where?</font>

947
00:57:23,040 --> 00:57:26,320
<font color="#ffff00">Well, you don't have much choice,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">do you?</font>

948
00:57:28,120 --> 00:57:29,800
<font color="#00ffff">Ouch!</font>

949
00:57:29,800 --> 00:57:32,360
<font color="#00ffff">I suppose you know that hurts?</font>

950
00:57:32,360 --> 00:57:35,680
<font color="#ffff00">You mean this is your hair?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Of course.</font>

951
00:57:35,680 --> 00:57:39,080
<font color="#00ffff">I don't object to people climbing</font>
<font color="#00ffff">it. I'm quite used to it, actually.</font>

952
00:57:39,080 --> 00:57:42,960
<font color="#00ffff">But you would keep tugging so.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, I'm terribly sorry.</font>

953
00:57:42,960 --> 00:57:45,000
<font color="#00ffff">Are you a prince?</font><font color="#ffff00"> No. Why?</font>

954
00:57:45,000 --> 00:57:46,160
<font color="#00ffff">You're supposed to be.</font>

955
00:57:46,160 --> 00:57:49,000
<font color="#00ffff">I'm a princess,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">but I suppose you knew that.</font>

956
00:57:49,000 --> 00:57:53,280
<font color="#00ffff">My name's Rapunzel. You're not</font>
<font color="#00ffff">a woodcutter's son, by any chance?</font>

957
00:57:53,280 --> 00:57:56,800
<font color="#ffff00">No. I'm the son of a piper.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, how very disappointing.</font>

958
00:57:56,800 --> 00:57:58,800
<font color="#00ffff">In that case, you'd better go.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Goodbye.</font>

959
00:57:58,800 --> 00:58:00,560
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, Your Highness, wait.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Well?</font>

960
00:58:00,560 --> 00:58:02,720
<font color="#ffff00">I can't go back there.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">It's a sheer drop.</font>

961
00:58:02,720 --> 00:58:04,840
<font color="#ffff00">And, well,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I can't just stand out here.</font>

962
00:58:04,840 --> 00:58:06,560
<font color="#ffff00">I'll have to climb in</font>
<font color="#ffff00">through the window.</font>

963
00:58:06,560 --> 00:58:08,560
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, well, I don't know</font>
<font color="#00ffff">if that would be allowed.</font>

964
00:58:08,560 --> 00:58:10,320
<font color="#ffff00">Well, I won't stay long.</font>

965
00:58:10,320 --> 00:58:13,880
<font color="#ffff00">Just passing through, you might say.</font>

966
00:58:13,880 --> 00:58:17,560
<font color="#ffff00">Please.</font><font color="#00ffff"> It's a great pity</font>
<font color="#00ffff">you're not a prince.</font>

967
00:58:17,560 --> 00:58:19,640
<font color="#00ffff">You'd have made rather a good one.</font>

968
00:58:19,640 --> 00:58:22,400
<font color="#00ffff">Well, I suppose</font>
<font color="#00ffff">you'd better come inside.</font>

969
00:58:22,400 --> 00:58:24,680
<font color="#00ffff">But for goodness' sake, be quiet.</font>

970
00:58:32,160 --> 00:58:34,240
<font color="#ffff00">Rapunzel?</font>

971
00:58:34,240 --> 00:58:37,080
<font color="#ffff00">Your Highness, where have you gone?</font>

972
00:58:37,080 --> 00:58:38,760
<font color="#ffff00">Don't be silly. I'm not going...</font>

973
00:58:40,000 --> 00:58:42,520
<font color="#ffff00">Hey, this doesn't look like</font>
<font color="#ffff00">the inside</font>

974
00:58:42,520 --> 00:58:44,760
<font color="#ffff00">of a princess's castle to me.</font>

975
00:59:06,400 --> 00:59:09,800
<font color="#ffffff">MACHINE:</font><font color="#00ff00"> "'Christmas won't be</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Christmas without any presents,'</font>

976
00:59:09,800 --> 00:59:12,160
<font color="#00ff00">"grumbled Jo, lying on the rug.</font>

977
00:59:12,160 --> 00:59:16,120
<font color="#00ff00">"'It's so dreadful to be poor,'</font>
<font color="#00ff00">sighed Meg, looking down at her..."</font>

978
00:59:16,120 --> 00:59:17,920
<font color="#ffffff">HE TURNS MACHINE OFF</font>

979
00:59:27,520 --> 00:59:30,000
<font color="#ffffff">CLICKING</font>

980
00:59:35,200 --> 00:59:38,080
<font color="#ffff00">"The Doctor and Zoe...</font>

981
00:59:38,080 --> 00:59:41,760
<font color="#ffff00">"..unable to find their companion</font>
<font color="#ffff00">in the labyrinth,</font>

982
00:59:41,760 --> 00:59:46,480
<font color="#ffff00">"decided to return to the cave</font>
<font color="#ffff00">in search of him,</font>

983
00:59:46,480 --> 00:59:50,160
<font color="#ffff00">"where a new terror awaited them."</font>

984
00:59:52,920 --> 00:59:56,640
<font color="#ffffff">I imagine there must be</font>
<font color="#ffffff">at least one more test.</font>

985
00:59:56,640 --> 00:59:59,480
<font color="#ffffff">I wonder what it'll be.</font>

986
00:59:59,480 --> 01:00:02,040
<font color="#00ffff">I believe you're actually beginning</font>
<font color="#00ffff">to enjoy all this.</font>

987
01:00:03,240 --> 01:00:05,440
<font color="#00ffff">That wasn't there before, was it?</font>

988
01:00:05,440 --> 01:00:08,800
<font color="#ffffff">A statue.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Like the unicorn.</font>

989
01:00:09,880 --> 01:00:11,360
<font color="#ffffff">Yes,</font>

990
01:00:11,360 --> 01:00:16,240
<font color="#ffffff">only the unicorn was alive first</font>
<font color="#ffffff">and then became a statue.</font>

991
01:00:16,240 --> 01:00:20,000
<font color="#ffffff">Only this time...</font><font color="#00ffff"> What?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Have a care, Zoe.</font>

992
01:00:20,000 --> 01:00:23,600
<font color="#ffffff">I have a feeling the situation</font>
<font color="#ffffff">is going to be reversed.</font>

993
01:00:24,680 --> 01:00:26,200
<font color="#00ffff">It IS coming to life!</font>

994
01:00:26,200 --> 01:00:28,760
<font color="#ffffff">HISSING</font>

995
01:00:32,240 --> 01:00:33,600
<font color="#ffffff">Medusa!</font>

996
01:00:37,480 --> 01:00:40,480
<font color="#ffffff">CLICKING</font>

997
01:00:40,480 --> 01:00:43,120
<font color="#ffff00">"The Doctor and Zoe</font>

998
01:00:43,120 --> 01:00:47,040
<font color="#ffff00">"were face-to-face with Medusa.</font>

999
01:00:47,040 --> 01:00:49,680
<font color="#ffff00">"One glance from her eyes would...</font>

1000
01:00:49,680 --> 01:00:52,280
<font color="#ffff00">"..would turn them to stone!"</font>

1001
01:00:53,680 --> 01:00:57,120
<font color="#ffffff">Now, we know what we have to do,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Zoe.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Yes.</font>

1002
01:00:57,120 --> 01:00:59,560
<font color="#ffffff">HISSING</font>

1003
01:00:59,560 --> 01:01:02,480
<font color="#00ffff">She's moving.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">She's going to look at us!</font>

1004
01:01:02,480 --> 01:01:04,840
<font color="#ffffff">Zoe, we have to say,</font>

1005
01:01:04,840 --> 01:01:07,920
<font color="#ffffff">"Medusa does not exist."</font>
<font color="#00ffff">But she does!</font>

1006
01:01:07,920 --> 01:01:11,120
<font color="#ffffff">Zoe, Medusa is a myth!</font>

1007
01:01:11,120 --> 01:01:16,320
<font color="#ffffff">If you believe in her, she can turn</font>
<font color="#ffffff">us BOTH to stone. Now, Zoe, say it.</font>

1008
01:01:16,320 --> 01:01:19,000
<font color="#ffffff">The Medusa is a myth. Say it!</font>

1009
01:01:19,000 --> 01:01:21,840
<font color="#00ffff">But she's alive!</font><font color="#ffffff"> No!</font>
<font color="#00ffff">She's real!</font><font color="#ffffff"> No!</font>

1010
01:01:21,840 --> 01:01:25,080
<font color="#ffffff">Don't look in her eyes! Don't look!</font>

1011
01:01:25,080 --> 01:01:26,280
<font color="#ffffff">HISSING</font>

1012
01:01:26,280 --> 01:01:29,840
<font color="#ffffff">The Medusa does not exist.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">You must believe that.</font>

1013
01:01:29,840 --> 01:01:34,880
<font color="#00ffff">I can feel her fingertips like ice!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">No. That's marble.</font>

1014
01:01:34,880 --> 01:01:37,280
<font color="#ffffff">Think of her as a marble statue.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">A legend.</font>

1015
01:01:37,280 --> 01:01:41,200
<font color="#00ffff">But she's real! I've got to look</font>
<font color="#00ffff">at her! I've got to!</font>

1016
01:01:43,360 --> 01:01:47,400
<font color="#ffff00">One glance from her eyes</font>
<font color="#ffff00">would turn them to stone...</font>

1017
01:01:48,480 --> 01:01:51,560
<font color="#ffff00">..but all was not yet lost.</font>

1018
01:01:51,560 --> 01:01:56,280
<font color="#ffff00">Suddenly, the Doctor found a sword</font>
<font color="#ffff00">at his feet, picked it up...</font>

1019
01:01:56,280 --> 01:02:00,080
<font color="#ffff00">..and with one stroke slew the</font>
<font color="#ffff00">monster.</font>

1020
01:02:01,200 --> 01:02:04,800
<font color="#ffffff">A sword.</font><font color="#00ffff"> You're meant to use it like</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Perseus.</font>

1021
01:02:04,800 --> 01:02:08,000
<font color="#ffffff">Maybe it's another trap.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Doctor, please!</font>

1022
01:02:08,000 --> 01:02:12,080
<font color="#ffffff">No. How can I kill something</font>
<font color="#ffffff">that doesn't exist?</font>

1023
01:02:12,080 --> 01:02:14,600
<font color="#00ffff">I've got to open my eyes.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I've got to see.</font>

1024
01:02:14,600 --> 01:02:15,680
<font color="#ffffff">Wait!</font>

1025
01:02:15,680 --> 01:02:18,280
<font color="#ffffff">Perseus. Of course. A mirror.</font>

1026
01:02:19,480 --> 01:02:23,720
<font color="#ffffff">There. Look at her reflection</font>
<font color="#ffffff">in the mirror. Look.</font>

1027
01:02:23,720 --> 01:02:26,600
<font color="#ffffff">Can you see her?</font><font color="#00ffff"> Yes.</font>

1028
01:02:26,600 --> 01:02:29,160
<font color="#ffffff">This is how Perseus escaped.</font>

1029
01:02:29,160 --> 01:02:32,280
<font color="#ffffff">He looked at her reflection</font>
<font color="#ffffff">in his polished shield.</font>

1030
01:02:32,280 --> 01:02:34,320
<font color="#ffffff">There's no danger in the reflection.</font>

1031
01:02:41,640 --> 01:02:45,200
<font color="#ffffff">It's safe now.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">You can look now.</font>

1032
01:02:47,160 --> 01:02:50,640
<font color="#ffffff">The statue has become a statue</font>
<font color="#ffffff">again.</font>

1033
01:02:52,800 --> 01:02:55,720
<font color="#ffff00">Cancel. Cancel. Cancel.</font>

1034
01:02:55,720 --> 01:02:59,560
<font color="#ffff00">The Doctor test, report failure.</font>

1035
01:02:59,560 --> 01:03:01,040
<font color="#ffff00">Failure?</font>

1036
01:03:12,520 --> 01:03:14,760
<font color="#ffffff">ALARM SOUNDS</font>

1037
01:03:14,760 --> 01:03:19,040
<font color="#00ff00">Attention. Attention. There is</font>
<font color="#00ff00">a stranger inside the building.</font>

1038
01:03:19,040 --> 01:03:21,160
<font color="#00ff00">Call out the search party.</font>

1039
01:03:31,720 --> 01:03:34,440
<font color="#00ffff">Ah, the young traveller.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I had wondered.</font>

1040
01:03:34,440 --> 01:03:36,680
<font color="#ffff00">Have you been sent to find me?</font>

1041
01:03:36,680 --> 01:03:40,920
<font color="#00ffff">His companions were in a state of</font>
<font color="#00ffff">anxiety about his whereabouts.</font>

1042
01:03:40,920 --> 01:03:43,280
<font color="#ffff00">Companions! Zoe and the Doctor.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Where are they?</font>

1043
01:03:43,280 --> 01:03:45,680
<font color="#00ffff">Safe and well.</font><font color="#ffff00"> You've spoken to</font>
<font color="#ffff00">them?</font>

1044
01:03:45,680 --> 01:03:48,360
<font color="#00ffff">The gentleman desired to know</font>
<font color="#00ffff">where I came from</font>

1045
01:03:48,360 --> 01:03:50,680
<font color="#00ffff">and whither I was bound.</font>

1046
01:03:48,360 --> 01:03:50,680
<font color="#ffffff">STATIC BUZZES</font>

1047
01:03:50,680 --> 01:03:52,560
<font color="#ffff00">What's that?</font>

1048
01:03:52,560 --> 01:03:56,000
<font color="#00ffff">I heard nothing.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Probably that search party.</font>

1049
01:03:56,000 --> 01:03:59,240
<font color="#00ffff">By the laws of this kingdom,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">every chamber must be searched.</font>

1050
01:03:59,240 --> 01:04:02,680
<font color="#ffff00">If they find me, I'm done for.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">You should be put to death.</font>

1051
01:04:05,560 --> 01:04:08,440
<font color="#ffff00">What about you?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I should come to no harm.</font>

1052
01:04:08,440 --> 01:04:10,840
<font color="#ffff00">If you give me away this time,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I'm finished!</font>

1053
01:04:13,520 --> 01:04:16,920
<font color="#00ffff">I was ready with the hazard of my</font>
<font color="#00ffff">life to defend his person.</font>

1054
01:04:42,040 --> 01:04:45,480
<font color="#ffff00">Where have they gone?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Hm?</font><font color="#ffff00"> The white robots.</font>

1055
01:04:45,480 --> 01:04:50,160
<font color="#00ffff">Young sir, I do assure you,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">there were no such persons here.</font>

1056
01:04:50,160 --> 01:04:53,800
<font color="#ffff00">Aye. Robots or not,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I'm getting out of this place.</font>

1057
01:04:59,280 --> 01:05:01,440
<font color="#00ffff">You desire your liberty!</font>

1058
01:05:01,440 --> 01:05:05,120
<font color="#ffff00">Yes. I got in all right,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">but how do I get out?</font>

1059
01:05:05,120 --> 01:05:08,840
<font color="#00ffff">After some consideration,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I was of the opinion that...</font>

1060
01:05:08,840 --> 01:05:11,400
<font color="#ffff00">Go on, go on.</font>

1061
01:05:11,400 --> 01:05:13,480
<font color="#00ffff">..this was altogether impossible.</font>

1062
01:05:17,480 --> 01:05:20,440
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, yes. That's the citadel,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">all right.</font>

1063
01:05:20,440 --> 01:05:23,480
<font color="#ffffff">The question is, how do we get</font>
<font color="#ffffff">up there?</font>

1064
01:05:23,480 --> 01:05:25,360
<font color="#00ffff">It's a long way to climb.</font>

1065
01:05:23,480 --> 01:05:25,360
<font color="#ffffff">ZAPPING</font>

1066
01:05:25,360 --> 01:05:26,720
<font color="#ffffff">Zoe, duck.</font>

1067
01:05:33,000 --> 01:05:37,280
<font color="#00ffff">The Karkus.</font><font color="#00ff00"> You are my prisoners.</font>

1068
01:05:37,280 --> 01:05:39,760
<font color="#00ffff">It's the Karkus.</font><font color="#ffffff"> What?</font>

1069
01:05:39,760 --> 01:05:42,520
<font color="#00ff00">Come out</font>
<font color="#00ff00">and put ze hands above ze head.</font>

1070
01:05:43,960 --> 01:05:48,400
<font color="#00ffff">You know. He's fictional too.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Obey or I fire.</font>

1071
01:05:48,400 --> 01:05:50,600
<font color="#ffffff">With that thing? What sort of a gun</font>
<font color="#ffffff">is that?</font>

1072
01:05:50,600 --> 01:05:53,480
<font color="#00ffff">An anti-molecular ray</font>
<font color="#00ffff">disintegrator.</font>

1073
01:05:53,480 --> 01:05:57,080
<font color="#ffffff">Rubbish. Such a weapon</font>
<font color="#ffffff">is scientifically impossible.</font>

1074
01:05:57,080 --> 01:05:58,120
<font color="#ffffff">It doesn't exist.</font>

1075
01:05:59,400 --> 01:06:00,720
<font color="#00ff00">Argh!</font>

1076
01:06:00,720 --> 01:06:03,120
<font color="#ffffff">That seems to have taken</font>
<font color="#ffffff">care of that.</font>

1077
01:06:03,120 --> 01:06:05,240
<font color="#00ff00">I shall tear you limb from limb.</font>

1078
01:06:05,240 --> 01:06:07,520
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor, be careful. He could do it.</font>

1079
01:06:07,520 --> 01:06:09,840
<font color="#ffff00">The Karkus has superhuman strength!</font>

1080
01:06:09,840 --> 01:06:11,920
<font color="#00ff00">You will be mincemeat.</font>

1081
01:06:11,920 --> 01:06:14,920
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor, say it.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">You know he's a fictional character!</font>

1082
01:06:14,920 --> 01:06:17,160
<font color="#ffffff">But I've never heard of him!</font>

1083
01:06:17,160 --> 01:06:19,280
<font color="#ffffff">THEY ALL SHOUT</font>

1084
01:06:19,280 --> 01:06:21,160
<font color="#ffffff">What are you doing?</font>

1085
01:06:21,160 --> 01:06:23,640
<font color="#ffffff">Please, I'm sure we can talk this</font>
<font color="#ffffff">over. Oh!</font>

1086
01:06:23,640 --> 01:06:25,000
<font color="#ffffff">Argh!</font>

1087
01:06:25,000 --> 01:06:26,800
<font color="#ffffff">Zoe.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Lesson 17!</font>

1088
01:06:27,960 --> 01:06:29,520
<font color="#ffffff">Be careful.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Oh, dear.</font>

1089
01:06:33,520 --> 01:06:35,000
<font color="#00ffff">Lesson 32.</font>

1090
01:06:35,000 --> 01:06:37,240
<font color="#ffffff">GROWLING</font>

1091
01:06:38,400 --> 01:06:39,760
<font color="#ffffff">Ah!</font>

1092
01:06:43,200 --> 01:06:44,600
<font color="#00ffff">Oh!</font>

1093
01:06:46,520 --> 01:06:48,000
<font color="#ffffff">Don't do anything rash.</font>

1094
01:06:48,000 --> 01:06:49,960
<font color="#ffffff">YELLING</font>

1095
01:06:49,960 --> 01:06:52,440
<font color="#ffffff">GROWLING</font>

1096
01:06:58,640 --> 01:07:00,480
<font color="#ffffff">HE GROANS</font>

1097
01:07:01,720 --> 01:07:03,480
<font color="#00ff00">Mercy.</font><font color="#00ffff"> You'd better submit...</font>

1098
01:07:04,720 --> 01:07:07,480
<font color="#00ffff">The neck can't take much pressure.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Help...!</font>

1099
01:07:07,480 --> 01:07:09,600
<font color="#00ffff">Do you submit?</font><font color="#00ff00"> I submit!</font>

1100
01:07:10,960 --> 01:07:12,080
<font color="#00ffff">That's better.</font>

1101
01:07:14,360 --> 01:07:17,560
<font color="#00ff00">I am your slave. Command me.</font>

1102
01:07:17,560 --> 01:07:19,760
<font color="#00ffff">Do you know the way to the citadel?</font>
<font color="#00ff00">I know it.</font>

1103
01:07:21,520 --> 01:07:23,600
<font color="#ffffff">Take us up there,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">there's a good chap.</font>

1104
01:07:25,120 --> 01:07:26,600
<font color="#00ff00">I obey.</font>

1105
01:07:29,600 --> 01:07:34,680
<font color="#00ffff">We all follow his adventures</font>
<font color="#00ffff">in the "Hourly Telepress".</font>

1106
01:07:34,680 --> 01:07:38,200
<font color="#ffffff">A strip cartoon of the year 2000?</font>

1107
01:07:38,200 --> 01:07:41,080
<font color="#00ffff">You've been in the year 2000?</font>

1108
01:07:41,080 --> 01:07:43,800
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, but I had no time to follow</font>
<font color="#ffffff">cartoons.</font>

1109
01:07:43,800 --> 01:07:46,640
<font color="#00ffff">You'd better start following this</font>
<font color="#00ffff">one. He's halfway there. Come on!</font>

1110
01:07:50,040 --> 01:07:54,000
<font color="#ffffff">Well, thank you, Mr...</font>
<font color="#ffffff">What did you say his name was?</font>

1111
01:07:54,000 --> 01:07:58,400
<font color="#00ffff">K-A-R-K-U-S.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, yes. Mr Karkus. Thank you.</font>

1112
01:07:58,400 --> 01:08:01,280
<font color="#00ffff">We won't be needing you any longer.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Run along.</font>

1113
01:08:02,840 --> 01:08:04,160
<font color="#00ff00">I obey.</font>

1114
01:08:05,960 --> 01:08:07,480
<font color="#ffffff">Come along.</font>

1115
01:08:07,480 --> 01:08:09,480
<font color="#00ffff">You can't just ring the bell.</font>

1116
01:08:09,480 --> 01:08:11,480
<font color="#ffffff">Why not? It's the usual way.</font>

1117
01:08:11,480 --> 01:08:12,840
<font color="#ffffff">BELL RINGS</font>

1118
01:08:14,160 --> 01:08:16,760
<font color="#00ffff">Are you sure this is a good idea?</font>

1119
01:08:16,760 --> 01:08:19,160
<font color="#00ff00">State your name and attribution.</font>

1120
01:08:21,120 --> 01:08:23,560
<font color="#ffffff">I am the Karkus.</font>

1121
01:08:23,560 --> 01:08:27,280
<font color="#00ff00">And your attribution?</font><font color="#00ffff"> What's that?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Sh!</font>

1122
01:08:27,280 --> 01:08:31,840
<font color="#ffffff">Year 2000 comic strip creation.</font>

1123
01:08:31,840 --> 01:08:33,840
<font color="#ffffff">"The Hourly Telepress".</font>

1124
01:08:33,840 --> 01:08:36,200
<font color="#00ff00">Authenticated. You may enter.</font>

1125
01:08:37,760 --> 01:08:40,680
<font color="#ffffff">DOOR CREAKS</font>

1126
01:08:45,800 --> 01:08:49,000
<font color="#ffff00">Come on! You heard them giving</font>
<font color="#ffff00">orders to look for me.</font>

1127
01:08:49,000 --> 01:08:51,080
<font color="#ffff00">Why do you suppose that happened?</font>

1128
01:08:51,080 --> 01:08:54,840
<font color="#00ffff">These were orders given</font>
<font color="#00ffff">by some person in authority.</font>

1129
01:08:54,840 --> 01:08:57,240
<font color="#ffff00">The Master?</font><font color="#00ffff"> It is possible.</font>

1130
01:08:57,240 --> 01:09:00,080
<font color="#ffff00">Now I'm getting somewhere. Listen...</font>

1131
01:09:01,280 --> 01:09:03,000
<font color="#ffff00">If there aren't any robots,</font>

1132
01:09:03,000 --> 01:09:05,720
<font color="#ffff00">who do you think was carrying out</font>
<font color="#ffff00">those orders?</font>

1133
01:09:05,720 --> 01:09:07,680
<font color="#ffff00">Who was I hiding from?</font>

1134
01:09:07,680 --> 01:09:11,000
<font color="#00ffff">Why, sir, the Yahoos.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Who's the Yahoos?</font>

1135
01:09:11,000 --> 01:09:15,280
<font color="#00ffff">Inferior creatures. I never beheld</font>
<font color="#00ffff">so disagreeable an animal.</font>

1136
01:09:15,280 --> 01:09:20,120
<font color="#ffff00">I haven't seen any Yahoos,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">you haven't seen any robots...</font>

1137
01:09:20,120 --> 01:09:22,120
<font color="#00ffff">Jamie!</font><font color="#ffffff"> Stay where you are.</font>

1138
01:09:22,120 --> 01:09:26,120
<font color="#ffff00">There's an electrical gadget</font>
<font color="#ffff00">that sets off an alarm.</font>

1139
01:09:26,120 --> 01:09:29,600
<font color="#ffff00">The gong went off</font>
<font color="#ffff00">and they sent robots after me.</font>

1140
01:09:29,600 --> 01:09:33,280
<font color="#00ffff">Robots? The ones we saw before?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Big white ones, aye.</font>

1141
01:09:33,280 --> 01:09:37,320
<font color="#00ffff">Doctor, did you hear that?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Yes. I thought they'd turn up.</font>

1142
01:09:37,320 --> 01:09:41,280
<font color="#ffffff">It's a simple photo-electric cell.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I'd better lift you over it.</font>

1143
01:09:41,280 --> 01:09:45,000
<font color="#ffff00">Careful, because... Oh, my jacket.</font>

1144
01:09:46,680 --> 01:09:49,200
<font color="#00ffff">What happened when you left the</font>
<font color="#00ffff">tunnel?</font><font color="#ffff00"> I was chased</font>

1145
01:09:49,200 --> 01:09:52,440
<font color="#ffff00">by one of those tin soldiers.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I climbed up the cliff.</font>

1146
01:09:52,440 --> 01:09:56,600
<font color="#ffff00">How do we get out?</font><font color="#ffffff"> I'm not leaving</font>
<font color="#ffffff">yet. I'm here on business.</font>

1147
01:09:56,600 --> 01:09:59,560
<font color="#00ffff">The Doctor's going to see</font>
<font color="#00ffff">the Master.</font>

1148
01:09:59,560 --> 01:10:03,320
<font color="#00ff00">This resolution may appear bold</font>
<font color="#00ff00">and dangerous.</font>

1149
01:10:03,320 --> 01:10:05,880
<font color="#00ffff">You see?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Why do you say that?</font>

1150
01:10:05,880 --> 01:10:07,600
<font color="#00ff00">I think you should not be here.</font>

1151
01:10:07,600 --> 01:10:12,800
<font color="#00ff00">The Master makes rules for his</font>
<font color="#00ff00">kingdom. It is unwise to disobey.</font>

1152
01:10:12,800 --> 01:10:14,680
<font color="#00ffff">So we shouldn't see the Master?</font>

1153
01:10:14,680 --> 01:10:18,760
<font color="#00ff00">My advice is to swear</font>
<font color="#00ff00">a peace with the Master.</font>

1154
01:10:18,760 --> 01:10:24,080
<font color="#00ff00">Find a place to lodge, stay with the</font>
<font color="#00ff00">expectation that things would mend.</font>

1155
01:10:24,080 --> 01:10:28,600
<font color="#ffffff">Yes. Well, I'll see. I'll</font>
<font color="#ffffff">think it over very carefully.</font>

1156
01:10:28,600 --> 01:10:30,520
<font color="#00ff00">Your servant.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Your servant.</font>

1157
01:10:34,800 --> 01:10:36,240
<font color="#00ff00">Your servant.</font>

1158
01:10:39,560 --> 01:10:43,000
<font color="#ffff00">You're not going to do as he says?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">No.</font>

1159
01:10:43,000 --> 01:10:46,800
<font color="#ffffff">I said I'd think it over.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I've thought it over. We're staying.</font>

1160
01:10:46,800 --> 01:10:48,680
<font color="#00ffff">We'll be fighting in the dark!</font>

1161
01:10:48,680 --> 01:10:50,880
<font color="#00ffff">We won't know where the</font>
<font color="#00ffff">next attack will come from.</font>

1162
01:10:50,880 --> 01:10:52,720
<font color="#00ffff">Medusa was bad enough.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Ah, Medusa.</font>

1163
01:10:52,720 --> 01:10:55,320
<font color="#ffff00">I read about that on this machine.</font>

1164
01:10:55,320 --> 01:10:58,960
<font color="#ffff00">Wee words keep coming out of it.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Let's have a look.</font>

1165
01:10:58,960 --> 01:11:01,120
<font color="#ffff00">There. Look.</font>

1166
01:11:01,120 --> 01:11:05,120
<font color="#ffffff">Cancel... The Doctor, test report -</font>
<font color="#ffffff">failure...</font>

1167
01:11:07,360 --> 01:11:10,280
<font color="#ffffff">I'm beginning to understand.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I wish I was.</font>

1168
01:11:10,280 --> 01:11:14,200
<font color="#ffffff">When somebody writes about</font>
<font color="#ffffff">an incident after it's happened,</font>

1169
01:11:14,200 --> 01:11:17,200
<font color="#ffffff">that is history.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Yes...</font>

1170
01:11:17,200 --> 01:11:21,560
<font color="#ffffff">But when the writing comes first,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">that's fiction.</font>

1171
01:11:22,640 --> 01:11:25,240
<font color="#ffffff">If we'd have fallen into</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the Master's trap,</font>

1172
01:11:25,240 --> 01:11:27,240
<font color="#ffffff">we would have become fiction.</font>

1173
01:11:27,240 --> 01:11:31,600
<font color="#00ffff">That's horrible. Let's get out of</font>
<font color="#00ffff">here.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Zoe, don't go...</font>

1174
01:11:31,600 --> 01:11:33,320
<font color="#ffffff">Not from there!</font>

1175
01:11:33,320 --> 01:11:34,680
<font color="#ffffff">BEEP</font>

1176
01:11:34,680 --> 01:11:38,440
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, no!</font><font color="#ffffff"> TANNOY:</font><font color="#00ff00"> Attention.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">There are still strangers at large.</font>

1177
01:11:38,440 --> 01:11:41,440
<font color="#00ff00">Renew the search.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">The strangers must be found.</font>

1178
01:11:41,440 --> 01:11:44,520
<font color="#00ffff">What are we going to do?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Gulliver walked through.</font>

1179
01:11:44,520 --> 01:11:46,920
<font color="#ffffff">Gulliver is not real - we are.</font>

1180
01:11:46,920 --> 01:11:49,520
<font color="#00ffff">They're coming. Where can we hide?</font>

1181
01:11:49,520 --> 01:11:52,440
<font color="#ffffff">No need to hide.</font><font color="#00ffff"> If they find us...</font>
<font color="#ffffff">STATIC BUZZES</font>

1182
01:11:52,440 --> 01:11:54,480
<font color="#ffffff">Let them find us.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Just wait?!</font>

1183
01:11:54,480 --> 01:11:57,960
<font color="#ffffff">Yes. We'll ask for an interview</font>
<font color="#ffffff">with the Master.</font>

1184
01:11:57,960 --> 01:12:01,280
<font color="#00ffff">They may not give us time to</font>
<font color="#00ffff">ask...</font><font color="#ffff00"> Look!</font>

1185
01:12:01,280 --> 01:12:05,720
<font color="#ffffff">Are you looking for us?</font>

1186
01:12:05,720 --> 01:12:07,800
<font color="#ffffff">STATIC BUZZES</font>

1187
01:12:14,560 --> 01:12:16,560
<font color="#ffffff">We demand an interview with</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the Master!</font>

1188
01:12:22,360 --> 01:12:24,200
<font color="#ffffff">CHUCKLING</font>

1189
01:12:24,200 --> 01:12:28,680
<font color="#ffff00">How very fortunate.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Do come in, Doctor.</font>

1190
01:12:28,680 --> 01:12:30,920
<font color="#ffff00">I've been expecting you.</font>

1191
01:12:32,120 --> 01:12:37,280
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, don't be alarmed.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Won't you walk into my parlour?</font>

1192
01:12:37,280 --> 01:12:40,480
<font color="#ffffff">Said the spider to the fly...</font>

1193
01:12:43,440 --> 01:12:45,160
<font color="#ffffff">Come along.</font>

1194
01:12:55,560 --> 01:12:58,960
<font color="#ffffff">It's hard to see anything.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Where are you?</font>

1195
01:13:00,280 --> 01:13:04,560
<font color="#ffff00">Here. Patiently waiting.</font>

1196
01:13:12,040 --> 01:13:15,360
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, Doctor.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">This is a great pleasure.</font>

1197
01:13:15,360 --> 01:13:19,280
<font color="#ffff00">And your two young companions.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Let me see. Oh, yes.</font>

1198
01:13:19,280 --> 01:13:22,480
<font color="#ffff00">Zoe and Jamie.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I have your dossiers here.</font>

1199
01:13:22,480 --> 01:13:25,680
<font color="#00ffff">You're well organised.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Yes. We have to be.</font>

1200
01:13:25,680 --> 01:13:29,320
<font color="#ffff00">Running this place requires</font>
<font color="#ffff00">enormous attention to detail.</font>

1201
01:13:29,320 --> 01:13:32,640
<font color="#ffff00">It's a responsible position,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">but very rewarding.</font>

1202
01:13:32,640 --> 01:13:35,120
<font color="#ffffff">Responsible, eh?</font>

1203
01:13:35,120 --> 01:13:39,240
<font color="#ffffff">To someone else?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Not to someone. Another power.</font>

1204
01:13:39,240 --> 01:13:42,360
<font color="#ffff00">Higher than any you</font>
<font color="#ffff00">could begin to imagine.</font>

1205
01:13:42,360 --> 01:13:45,720
<font color="#ffff00">I must congratulate you</font>
<font color="#ffff00">on the great skill</font>

1206
01:13:45,720 --> 01:13:49,520
<font color="#ffff00">in which you tackled</font>
<font color="#ffff00">your examination.</font>

1207
01:13:49,520 --> 01:13:52,360
<font color="#ffffff">What is the purpose</font>
<font color="#ffffff">of all these tests?</font>

1208
01:13:52,360 --> 01:13:55,680
<font color="#ffff00">When I was first brought here</font>
<font color="#ffff00">myself,</font>

1209
01:13:55,680 --> 01:13:57,840
<font color="#ffff00">I was as bewildered as you are.</font>

1210
01:13:57,840 --> 01:13:59,360
<font color="#ffffff">How long have you been here?</font>

1211
01:13:59,360 --> 01:14:02,280
<font color="#ffff00">I left England</font>
<font color="#ffff00">in the summer of 1926.</font>

1212
01:14:02,280 --> 01:14:04,520
<font color="#ffffff">HE CHUCKLES</font>

1213
01:14:04,520 --> 01:14:06,800
<font color="#ffff00">It was a very hot day, I remember.</font>

1214
01:14:06,800 --> 01:14:08,040
<font color="#ffff00">Hm.</font>

1215
01:14:08,040 --> 01:14:12,280
<font color="#ffff00">I think I must have dozed off</font>
<font color="#ffff00">over my desk, and when I awoke...</font>

1216
01:14:12,280 --> 01:14:15,080
<font color="#ffff00">Ho-ho-ho! But that's a long story.</font>

1217
01:14:16,160 --> 01:14:19,760
<font color="#ffff00">Did you ever hear of the adventures</font>
<font color="#ffff00">of Captain Jack Harkaway?</font>

1218
01:14:21,160 --> 01:14:22,880
<font color="#ffffff">No, I can't say that I...</font>

1219
01:14:22,880 --> 01:14:24,760
<font color="#ffffff">Wait a minute!</font>

1220
01:14:24,760 --> 01:14:29,120
<font color="#ffffff">A serial in a boys' magazine?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">The Ensign!</font><font color="#ffffff"> The Ensign...</font>

1221
01:14:29,120 --> 01:14:33,240
<font color="#ffff00">And for 25 years,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I delivered 5,000 words every week.</font>

1222
01:14:33,240 --> 01:14:35,120
<font color="#ffffff">You're a writer.</font>

1223
01:14:35,120 --> 01:14:37,800
<font color="#ffffff">25 years, 5,000 words a week.</font>

1224
01:14:37,800 --> 01:14:42,920
<font color="#00ffff">That's over half a million words.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Yes. It was probably a record.</font>

1225
01:14:42,920 --> 01:14:46,000
<font color="#ffff00">That's why I was selected to work</font>
<font color="#ffff00">here.</font>

1226
01:14:46,000 --> 01:14:50,000
<font color="#00ff00">You're in charge of all this?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">In one sense, yes.</font>

1227
01:14:50,000 --> 01:14:53,600
<font color="#ffffff">Yes. Or is all this in charge of</font>
<font color="#ffffff">you?</font>

1228
01:14:53,600 --> 01:14:57,920
<font color="#ffff00">My brain...is the source</font>
<font color="#ffff00">of the creative power,</font>

1229
01:14:57,920 --> 01:15:01,080
<font color="#ffff00">which keeps this whole operation</font>
<font color="#ffff00">going.</font>

1230
01:15:01,080 --> 01:15:05,400
<font color="#ffffff">I see. That means</font>
<font color="#ffffff">that you are virtually a prisoner.</font>

1231
01:15:05,400 --> 01:15:07,600
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, no, no, no, no...</font>

1232
01:15:07,600 --> 01:15:09,640
<font color="#ffffff">ALARM BLARES</font>

1233
01:15:09,640 --> 01:15:11,680
<font color="#ffffff">CRACKLING</font>

1234
01:15:15,680 --> 01:15:16,720
<font color="#ffff00">Oh...</font>

1235
01:15:18,680 --> 01:15:20,760
<font color="#ffff00">You must excuse me for one moment.</font>

1236
01:15:25,920 --> 01:15:28,840
<font color="#00ff00">Let's get out of here.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">It gives me the creeps.</font>

1237
01:15:28,840 --> 01:15:31,000
<font color="#ffffff">No, I need to find out more.</font>

1238
01:15:31,000 --> 01:15:33,680
<font color="#00ff00">Keep him talking and</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Zoe and me will find a way out.</font>

1239
01:15:33,680 --> 01:15:36,440
<font color="#ffffff">I think it'll be safer to all</font>
<font color="#ffffff">stick together.</font>

1240
01:15:36,440 --> 01:15:40,280
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, sorry to have kept you.</font>

1241
01:15:40,280 --> 01:15:41,640
<font color="#ffff00">Where were we?</font>

1242
01:15:41,640 --> 01:15:45,600
<font color="#ffffff">You were about to answer my</font>
<font color="#ffffff">question. Are you a prisoner here?</font>

1243
01:15:45,600 --> 01:15:48,960
<font color="#ffff00">Well, no. No, I wouldn't say that...</font>

1244
01:15:48,960 --> 01:15:52,040
<font color="#ffff00">In fact, I rather like being here.</font>

1245
01:15:52,040 --> 01:15:54,560
<font color="#ffff00">I have everything</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I could possibly want.</font>

1246
01:15:54,560 --> 01:15:57,760
<font color="#ffff00">This vast library with</font>
<font color="#ffff00">all the known works of fiction.</font>

1247
01:15:57,760 --> 01:16:00,480
<font color="#ffff00">All the masterpieces written by</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Earthmen</font>

1248
01:16:00,480 --> 01:16:02,160
<font color="#ffff00">since the beginning of time!</font>

1249
01:16:06,720 --> 01:16:11,360
<font color="#00ffff">I don't think he noticed.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">No. Let's try down there.</font>

1250
01:16:12,880 --> 01:16:17,000
<font color="#ffffff">I see, yes. And only an</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Earthman-type creature</font>

1251
01:16:17,000 --> 01:16:20,520
<font color="#ffffff">has the power to create fiction.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">The power to imagine.</font>

1252
01:16:20,520 --> 01:16:22,120
<font color="#ffff00">Exactly!</font>

1253
01:16:22,120 --> 01:16:26,640
<font color="#ffff00">This is one field in which the</font>
<font color="#ffff00">intelligence I serve cannot compete.</font>

1254
01:16:26,640 --> 01:16:31,880
<font color="#ffff00">They need a man, of boundless</font>
<font color="#ffff00">imagination as a...</font>

1255
01:16:31,880 --> 01:16:35,800
<font color="#ffff00">..a powerhouse, a lifeline,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">you might say.</font>

1256
01:16:35,800 --> 01:16:40,200
<font color="#ffffff">What is this intelligence you serve</font>
<font color="#ffffff">and why was I brought here?</font>

1257
01:16:40,200 --> 01:16:44,480
<font color="#ffff00">Well, as you see,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I'm no longer young,</font>

1258
01:16:44,480 --> 01:16:47,680
<font color="#ffff00">whereas you, Doctor, are ageless.</font>

1259
01:16:47,680 --> 01:16:52,560
<font color="#ffff00">You exist outside</font>
<font color="#ffff00">the barriers of time and space.</font>

1260
01:16:52,560 --> 01:16:55,480
<font color="#ffffff">And you want me...</font>

1261
01:16:55,480 --> 01:16:59,120
<font color="#ffff00">To take over this unique situation!</font>

1262
01:16:59,120 --> 01:17:00,480
<font color="#ffff00">To take my place.</font>

1263
01:17:01,480 --> 01:17:02,800
<font color="#ffffff">I refuse.</font>

1264
01:17:02,800 --> 01:17:04,760
<font color="#ffffff">ALARM BLARES</font>

1265
01:17:04,760 --> 01:17:06,040
<font color="#ffffff">CRACKLING</font>

1266
01:17:08,040 --> 01:17:10,720
<font color="#ffffff">ROBOTICALLY:</font><font color="#ffff00"> Refusal is impossible.</font>

1267
01:17:10,720 --> 01:17:13,080
<font color="#ffff00">You are here to serve us.</font>

1268
01:17:13,080 --> 01:17:14,960
<font color="#ffff00">There is no alternative.</font>

1269
01:17:16,520 --> 01:17:18,160
<font color="#ffffff">STATIC BUZZES</font>

1270
01:17:18,160 --> 01:17:21,280
<font color="#00ffff">We've got to find a way out!</font>
<font color="#00ff00">There must be a door somewhere.</font>

1271
01:17:21,280 --> 01:17:24,360
<font color="#00ff00">We've got to get the Doctor</font>
<font color="#00ff00">away before...</font><font color="#00ffff"> Jamie!</font>

1272
01:17:24,360 --> 01:17:26,480
<font color="#00ff00">Stop!</font>

1273
01:17:26,480 --> 01:17:29,840
<font color="#00ff00">No. Back this way.</font>

1274
01:17:29,840 --> 01:17:31,840
<font color="#ffff00">Resistance is useless.</font>

1275
01:17:31,840 --> 01:17:34,520
<font color="#ffff00">Submit your will for the sake</font>
<font color="#ffff00">of the greater good.</font>

1276
01:17:34,520 --> 01:17:36,640
<font color="#ffff00">It has been decided.</font>

1277
01:17:36,640 --> 01:17:37,960
<font color="#ffffff">I refuse.</font>

1278
01:17:37,960 --> 01:17:39,960
<font color="#ffffff">I shall make that decision</font>
<font color="#ffffff">for myself.</font>

1279
01:17:40,960 --> 01:17:47,360
<font color="#ffff00">You will find there is</font>
<font color="#ffff00">only one decision open to you.</font>

1280
01:17:49,600 --> 01:17:54,080
<font color="#ffff00">Mission accomplished.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Procedure as arranged.</font>

1281
01:17:54,080 --> 01:17:55,840
<font color="#ffffff">What does that mean?</font>

1282
01:17:55,840 --> 01:17:59,160
<font color="#ffff00">The latest chapter</font>
<font color="#ffff00">of the serial story.</font>

1283
01:17:59,160 --> 01:18:02,120
<font color="#ffff00">I'll read you the last sentence.</font>

1284
01:18:02,120 --> 01:18:04,880
<font color="#ffff00">Zoe and Jamie attempted to escape,</font>

1285
01:18:04,880 --> 01:18:08,520
<font color="#ffff00">but...in making through the</font>
<font color="#ffff00">library,</font>

1286
01:18:08,520 --> 01:18:13,080
<font color="#ffff00">they were ambushed by a party</font>
<font color="#ffff00">of guards and overpowered.</font>

1287
01:18:13,080 --> 01:18:15,440
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, no! Jamie. Zoe!</font>

1288
01:18:15,440 --> 01:18:18,760
<font color="#ffff00">Are you prepared to co-operate now?</font>

1289
01:18:18,760 --> 01:18:21,600
<font color="#ffff00">Your life in return for theirs?</font>

1290
01:18:21,600 --> 01:18:23,120
<font color="#ffff00">Is that a bargain?</font>

1291
01:18:24,120 --> 01:18:26,160
<font color="#ffffff">HE LAUGHS</font>

1292
01:18:26,160 --> 01:18:27,240
<font color="#ffff00">Look.</font>

1293
01:18:31,400 --> 01:18:33,240
<font color="#ffffff">HE MOANS, STRAINS</font>

1294
01:18:36,040 --> 01:18:37,680
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, Jamie, my eyes!</font>

1295
01:18:37,680 --> 01:18:39,520
<font color="#00ff00">I can't see. Where are you?</font>

1296
01:18:40,920 --> 01:18:43,240
<font color="#00ff00">Quick, back. Get away.</font>

1297
01:18:43,240 --> 01:18:45,280
<font color="#00ff00">Zoe, here, quick.</font>

1298
01:18:45,280 --> 01:18:46,480
<font color="#00ffff">Oh!</font>

1299
01:18:47,760 --> 01:18:50,440
<font color="#00ff00">No. It's a book. Back out again!</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, no!</font>

1300
01:18:50,440 --> 01:18:55,000
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, push.</font><font color="#00ff00"> Open up. It's closing.</font>

1301
01:18:55,000 --> 01:18:56,320
<font color="#00ffff">No!</font><font color="#00ff00"> Argh!</font>

1302
01:18:58,200 --> 01:18:59,440
<font color="#ffffff">What have you done?!</font>

1303
01:18:59,440 --> 01:19:03,680
<font color="#00ff00">They're no longer human,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">just fictional characters.</font>

1304
01:19:03,680 --> 01:19:07,720
<font color="#00ff00">If you consent to take my place</font>
<font color="#00ff00">here, they can be released.</font>

1305
01:19:07,720 --> 01:19:11,160
<font color="#ffffff">You really would do that?</font>
<font color="#00ff00">No, my dear sir. YOU would.</font>

1306
01:19:11,160 --> 01:19:13,040
<font color="#00ff00">Once you take up your post here,</font>

1307
01:19:13,040 --> 01:19:17,440
<font color="#00ff00">it can be your first official task</font>
<font color="#00ff00">as the new controller.</font>

1308
01:19:17,440 --> 01:19:22,120
<font color="#ffffff">I see. How very ingenious.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">I take it, then, that you agree?</font>

1309
01:19:22,120 --> 01:19:25,640
<font color="#ffffff">No! My answer is still no.</font>

1310
01:19:25,640 --> 01:19:28,800
<font color="#00ff00">How very unfortunate.</font>

1311
01:19:37,400 --> 01:19:42,440
<font color="#00ff00">I'm sorry to have to use violent</font>
<font color="#00ff00">methods, but you must submit.</font>

1312
01:19:42,440 --> 01:19:44,640
<font color="#00ff00">You have no alternative.</font>

1313
01:19:44,640 --> 01:19:49,280
<font color="#ffffff">I have yet to see a robot</font>
<font color="#ffffff">that can climb!</font>

1314
01:19:52,360 --> 01:19:54,040
<font color="#00ff00">You cannot escape...</font>

1315
01:19:55,120 --> 01:19:59,960
<font color="#00ff00">..but we will play your game</font>
<font color="#00ff00">a little longer.</font>

1316
01:19:59,960 --> 01:20:02,000
<font color="#ffffff">HE LAUGHS WICKEDLY</font>

1317
01:20:28,080 --> 01:20:30,800
<font color="#00ffff">Doctor!</font><font color="#ffffff"> Ah, Zoe! Jamie!</font>

1318
01:20:30,800 --> 01:20:33,440
<font color="#ffff00">Am I glad to see you?!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">The Master said you'd been...</font>

1319
01:20:33,440 --> 01:20:36,000
<font color="#ffff00">Where do we go from here?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Back to the TARDIS.</font>

1320
01:20:36,000 --> 01:20:38,600
<font color="#ffff00">We can't. It fell apart.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Don't you remember?</font>

1321
01:20:38,600 --> 01:20:41,800
<font color="#00ffff">It's all over now, thank goodness.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">The TARDIS broke up.</font>

1322
01:20:41,800 --> 01:20:45,920
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, you said that.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I'm tired. I think I'll sit down.</font>

1323
01:20:45,920 --> 01:20:47,680
<font color="#ffffff">Is something wrong, Zoe?</font>

1324
01:20:47,680 --> 01:20:50,360
<font color="#ffff00">Where do we go?</font><font color="#00ffff"> To the TARDIS.</font>

1325
01:20:50,360 --> 01:20:52,960
<font color="#ffff00">We can't. It broke up.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Don't you remember?</font>

1326
01:20:54,120 --> 01:20:57,480
<font color="#ffffff">But you...keep saying</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the same things.</font>

1327
01:21:00,120 --> 01:21:01,800
<font color="#ffff00">The TARDIS broke up.</font>

1328
01:21:03,800 --> 01:21:07,360
<font color="#ffffff">Then, it's true. They're not real.</font>

1329
01:21:07,360 --> 01:21:09,320
<font color="#ffffff">They've been turned into fiction.</font>

1330
01:21:12,200 --> 01:21:14,000
<font color="#ffffff">What's this?</font>

1331
01:21:23,040 --> 01:21:24,960
<font color="#ffffff">The master tape!</font>

1332
01:21:24,960 --> 01:21:26,960
<font color="#ffffff">I wonder...</font>

1333
01:21:26,960 --> 01:21:28,840
<font color="#ffffff">Perhaps if I were to create</font>

1334
01:21:28,840 --> 01:21:31,920
<font color="#ffffff">a few immortal words of fiction of</font>
<font color="#ffffff">my own...</font>

1335
01:21:31,920 --> 01:21:33,760
<font color="#ffffff">Yes. It's worth trying.</font>

1336
01:21:36,680 --> 01:21:38,960
<font color="#ffffff">What I need is the strength</font>
<font color="#ffffff">of Karkus.</font>

1337
01:21:41,040 --> 01:21:42,480
<font color="#00ff00">I am at your command!</font>

1338
01:21:42,480 --> 01:21:44,800
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, thank you, my dear sir.</font>

1339
01:21:44,800 --> 01:21:47,280
<font color="#ffffff">Perhaps you could release this</font>
<font color="#ffffff">for me.</font>

1340
01:21:51,760 --> 01:21:53,400
<font color="#00ff00">This is what you want?</font>

1341
01:21:53,400 --> 01:21:56,200
<font color="#ffffff">No. I want to get down here somehow.</font>

1342
01:21:56,200 --> 01:21:58,480
<font color="#00ff00">Ah. Wait.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Oh, thank you.</font>

1343
01:21:59,920 --> 01:22:01,880
<font color="#ffffff">Jamie.</font>

1344
01:22:01,880 --> 01:22:07,000
<font color="#ffffff">Jamie, Zoe.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">You are being controlled.</font>

1345
01:22:07,000 --> 01:22:09,600
<font color="#ffffff">Jamie, listen. Listen.</font>

1346
01:22:09,600 --> 01:22:11,800
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, it's no use.</font>

1347
01:22:11,800 --> 01:22:13,440
<font color="#00ff00">A rope.</font>

1348
01:22:13,440 --> 01:22:17,200
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, thank you.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Ouch! Careful.</font>

1349
01:22:17,200 --> 01:22:19,880
<font color="#ffffff">Oh. Yes, of course.</font>

1350
01:22:19,880 --> 01:22:22,120
<font color="#ffffff">You are the Princess Rapunzel.</font>

1351
01:22:22,120 --> 01:22:25,680
<font color="#00ffff">Are you a prince?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">No, I'm afraid not.</font>

1352
01:22:25,680 --> 01:22:28,680
<font color="#ffffff">Would you mind if I used your hair</font>
<font color="#ffffff">to get down there?</font>

1353
01:22:28,680 --> 01:22:31,840
<font color="#00ffff">No, of course not.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Everybody else uses it.</font>

1354
01:22:31,840 --> 01:22:36,280
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you. Where can we attach</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the...? Oh, yes, of course.</font>

1355
01:22:49,400 --> 01:22:51,560
<font color="#ffffff">KEYS CLACK</font>

1356
01:22:59,960 --> 01:23:02,520
<font color="#00ff00">Yes, yes. Go on!</font>

1357
01:23:02,520 --> 01:23:06,640
<font color="#ffffff">The enemy had been finally defeated</font>
<font color="#ffffff">by the Doctor.</font>

1358
01:23:08,320 --> 01:23:11,840
<font color="#ffffff">No, no. I can't say that.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">If I say that...</font>

1359
01:23:14,120 --> 01:23:16,280
<font color="#ffffff">I nearly fell for it.</font>

1360
01:23:16,280 --> 01:23:19,840
<font color="#ffffff">Another two seconds, and I should</font>
<font color="#ffffff">have turned myself into fiction!</font>

1361
01:23:28,560 --> 01:23:29,760
<font color="#00ff00">Halt.</font>

1362
01:23:30,720 --> 01:23:34,840
<font color="#00ff00">Now we shall play games no longer.</font>

1363
01:23:34,840 --> 01:23:39,120
<font color="#ffffff">I'm very obliged to you both.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Always happy to be of assistance.</font>

1364
01:23:40,840 --> 01:23:45,640
<font color="#ffffff">Jamie and Zoe. I left them here.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Where are they? Jamie! Zoe!</font>

1365
01:23:45,640 --> 01:23:49,080
<font color="#ffff00">They had to make a departure.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">It was necessary.</font>

1366
01:23:49,080 --> 01:23:51,920
<font color="#ffffff">They'll be back soon.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">What's been happening?</font>

1367
01:23:51,920 --> 01:23:54,120
<font color="#ffffff">You must have SOME idea.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Is it a game?</font>

1368
01:23:55,640 --> 01:23:58,080
<font color="#ffffff">Please! Please! I must think!</font>

1369
01:23:58,080 --> 01:24:01,520
<font color="#ffffff">There must be a way out of this.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">There's GOT to be.</font>

1370
01:24:04,480 --> 01:24:06,960
<font color="#00ff00">"Jamie and Zoe realised at last</font>

1371
01:24:06,960 --> 01:24:09,280
<font color="#00ff00">"that the Doctor was, in fact,</font>

1372
01:24:09,280 --> 01:24:12,440
<font color="#00ff00">"the most monstrous and cunning</font>
<font color="#00ff00">villain.</font>

1373
01:24:12,440 --> 01:24:15,200
<font color="#00ff00">"There was no punishment too severe</font>

1374
01:24:15,200 --> 01:24:18,120
<font color="#00ff00">"for the crimes that he had</font>
<font color="#00ff00">committed."</font>

1375
01:24:22,680 --> 01:24:26,680
<font color="#00ff00">Splendid. Splendid.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Come closer, my children.</font>

1376
01:24:29,240 --> 01:24:31,080
<font color="#ffff00">You sent for us, Master?</font>

1377
01:24:31,080 --> 01:24:35,080
<font color="#00ff00">Now you know what the Doctor</font>
<font color="#00ff00">is really like, don't you?</font>

1378
01:24:35,080 --> 01:24:37,520
<font color="#00ffff">He's the most monstrous and cunning</font>
<font color="#00ffff">villain.</font>

1379
01:24:37,520 --> 01:24:40,360
<font color="#ffff00">No punishment</font>
<font color="#ffff00">is too severe for his crimes.</font>

1380
01:24:40,360 --> 01:24:43,560
<font color="#00ff00">Word perfect. That is why I sent</font>
<font color="#00ff00">for you both</font>

1381
01:24:43,560 --> 01:24:45,480
<font color="#00ff00">at this moment of crisis.</font>

1382
01:24:45,480 --> 01:24:48,320
<font color="#00ff00">We need your help.</font><font color="#00ffff"> What must we do?</font>

1383
01:24:49,840 --> 01:24:51,480
<font color="#00ff00">Well...</font>

1384
01:24:51,480 --> 01:24:53,960
<font color="#ffffff"># A pocketful of posies</font>

1385
01:24:53,960 --> 01:24:56,040
<font color="#ffffff"># A-tishoo. A-tishoo</font>

1386
01:24:56,040 --> 01:24:58,400
<font color="#ffffff"># We all fall down! #</font>

1387
01:24:59,680 --> 01:25:01,840
<font color="#00ff00">You are in an unhappy situation.</font>

1388
01:25:01,840 --> 01:25:04,200
<font color="#00ffff">Is there anything we can do to</font>
<font color="#00ffff">help?</font>

1389
01:25:04,200 --> 01:25:06,520
<font color="#ffffff">I only wish there was.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Look!</font>

1390
01:25:06,520 --> 01:25:09,640
<font color="#00ff00">What's that?!</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I never saw it before.</font>

1391
01:25:09,640 --> 01:25:11,680
<font color="#ffffff">The TARDIS!</font>

1392
01:25:11,680 --> 01:25:15,400
<font color="#ffffff">Safe and sound!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">By all that's wonderful!</font>

1393
01:25:16,800 --> 01:25:19,920
<font color="#ffff00">Are you ready?</font><font color="#00ffff"> The time has come.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">The time?</font><font color="#00ffff"> To leave!</font>

1394
01:25:19,920 --> 01:25:23,360
<font color="#ffffff">How did you find the TARDIS?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">We'll explain later.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Come on!</font>

1395
01:25:23,360 --> 01:25:26,640
<font color="#ffffff">Just as I was thinking</font>
<font color="#ffffff">that all was over.</font>

1396
01:25:26,640 --> 01:25:29,680
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, no.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">It's not over yet, Doctor.</font>

1397
01:25:29,680 --> 01:25:31,360
<font color="#00ffff">Not yet.</font>

1398
01:25:31,360 --> 01:25:33,200
<font color="#ffffff">THEY LAUGH</font>

1399
01:25:33,200 --> 01:25:35,640
<font color="#ffffff">Agh! Jamie! Zoe!</font>

1400
01:25:38,960 --> 01:25:40,640
<font color="#ffffff">THEY LAUGH</font>

1401
01:25:43,440 --> 01:25:45,480
<font color="#ffffff">What's happening?!</font>

1402
01:25:49,040 --> 01:25:52,120
<font color="#00ff00">The children obeyed perfectly.</font>

1403
01:25:52,120 --> 01:25:54,840
<font color="#00ff00">Their mission is completed.</font>

1404
01:25:57,320 --> 01:26:00,480
<font color="#00ff00">Now perhaps we can get down to</font>
<font color="#00ff00">business.</font>

1405
01:26:00,480 --> 01:26:03,480
<font color="#00ff00">As you refused</font>
<font color="#00ff00">to take over at the controls,</font>

1406
01:26:03,480 --> 01:26:06,440
<font color="#00ff00">we were forced to incorporate you</font>
<font color="#00ff00">into the computer.</font>

1407
01:26:06,440 --> 01:26:07,720
<font color="#ffffff">To what purpose?</font>

1408
01:26:07,720 --> 01:26:11,280
<font color="#00ff00">To bring planet Earth under our</font>
<font color="#00ff00">control.</font>

1409
01:26:11,280 --> 01:26:14,440
<font color="#ffffff">And its people?</font>
<font color="#00ff00">We have no wish to destroy them.</font>

1410
01:26:14,440 --> 01:26:19,160
<font color="#00ff00">Merely adjust their minds</font>
<font color="#00ff00">to suit our purpose.</font>

1411
01:26:19,160 --> 01:26:23,440
<font color="#ffffff">Sausages. Man would become like</font>
<font color="#ffffff">a string of sausages - all the same.</font>

1412
01:26:23,440 --> 01:26:27,480
<font color="#00ff00">Man will simply vanish from</font>
<font color="#00ff00">the Earth and reappear here.</font>

1413
01:26:27,480 --> 01:26:32,640
<font color="#ffffff">Leaving Earth undamaged and</font>
<font color="#ffffff">uninhabited for you to take over.</font>

1414
01:26:32,640 --> 01:26:36,480
<font color="#00ff00">Precisely.</font><font color="#ffffff"> If I co-operate.</font>

1415
01:26:36,480 --> 01:26:41,280
<font color="#00ff00">You have no alternative.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">You are part of the Master Brain.</font>

1416
01:26:42,640 --> 01:26:46,240
<font color="#ffffff">So the computer</font>
<font color="#ffffff">feeds off my thoughts, does it?</font>

1417
01:26:46,240 --> 01:26:48,160
<font color="#00ff00">Correct.</font>

1418
01:26:48,160 --> 01:26:50,640
<font color="#ffffff">Then, it will create what I think.</font>

1419
01:26:50,640 --> 01:26:55,960
<font color="#00ff00">Oh, no. No. You're now under control</font>
<font color="#00ff00">of the Master Brain.</font>

1420
01:26:55,960 --> 01:26:59,800
<font color="#ffffff">Are you so sure? You couldn't</font>
<font color="#ffffff">control my mind before</font>

1421
01:26:59,800 --> 01:27:02,000
<font color="#ffffff">and you can't control it now.</font>

1422
01:27:02,000 --> 01:27:04,160
<font color="#00ff00">Submit!</font><font color="#ffffff"> No!</font>

1423
01:27:04,160 --> 01:27:08,600
<font color="#ffffff">You've given me equal power. It's a</font>
<font color="#ffffff">battle of wits between you and me.</font>

1424
01:27:10,200 --> 01:27:12,360
<font color="#00ff00">Oh, no. No. No!</font>

1425
01:27:12,360 --> 01:27:14,200
<font color="#00ff00">Stop. Stop.</font>

1426
01:27:14,200 --> 01:27:16,960
<font color="#ffffff">Jamie, Zoe.</font>

1427
01:27:16,960 --> 01:27:20,960
<font color="#ffffff">Can you hear me? Think</font>
<font color="#ffffff">for yourselves. Don't be afraid.</font>

1428
01:27:20,960 --> 01:27:24,520
<font color="#ffffff">You CAN open the book.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Go on, you can do it.</font>

1429
01:27:24,520 --> 01:27:27,040
<font color="#00ff00">Oh. Oh, dear.</font>

1430
01:27:27,040 --> 01:27:30,960
<font color="#00ff00">This is against everything</font>
<font color="#00ff00">we ever worked for.</font>

1431
01:27:30,960 --> 01:27:33,360
<font color="#00ff00">Warning, warning!</font>

1432
01:27:30,960 --> 01:27:33,360
<font color="#ffffff">WHIRRING</font>

1433
01:27:33,360 --> 01:27:36,720
<font color="#00ff00">Emergency action.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Emergency. Emergency!</font>

1434
01:27:36,720 --> 01:27:42,280
<font color="#ffffff">Don't worry about fiction. Hang on</font>
<font color="#ffffff">to real life. You've got to get out.</font>

1435
01:27:43,440 --> 01:27:45,600
<font color="#00ff00">Calling white robots.</font>

1436
01:27:45,600 --> 01:27:48,680
<font color="#00ff00">Guards will enter the control</font>
<font color="#00ff00">centre.</font>

1437
01:27:48,680 --> 01:27:52,360
<font color="#00ff00">The Master Brain must be protected.</font>

1438
01:27:52,360 --> 01:27:55,000
<font color="#ffffff">What IS it?</font><font color="#00ffff"> What are you saying?</font>

1439
01:27:55,000 --> 01:27:57,440
<font color="#00ff00">A game?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">We are not in the same service.</font>

1440
01:27:57,440 --> 01:27:59,160
<font color="#00ffff">You're going away from us.</font>

1441
01:28:04,840 --> 01:28:07,400
<font color="#ffff00">Push, Zoe. Push hard.</font>

1442
01:28:07,400 --> 01:28:09,960
<font color="#ffff00">We WILL get out.</font>

1443
01:28:12,120 --> 01:28:14,520
<font color="#00ff00">Soldiers! To the roof. Immediately!</font>

1444
01:28:14,520 --> 01:28:18,320
<font color="#ffffff">Jamie, Zoe, concentrate.</font>

1445
01:28:18,320 --> 01:28:22,200
<font color="#ffffff">You've got to get out of there.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Now push. Harder!</font>

1446
01:28:22,200 --> 01:28:23,880
<font color="#ffffff">Harder!</font>

1447
01:28:25,680 --> 01:28:27,440
<font color="#ffffff">Splendid!</font>

1448
01:28:27,440 --> 01:28:30,760
<font color="#00ff00">Soldiers, forward!</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Seize them. Destroy them.</font>

1449
01:28:30,760 --> 01:28:34,240
<font color="#ffffff">No! Jamie, Zoe, run.</font>

1450
01:28:36,160 --> 01:28:38,040
<font color="#ffff00">Get back, Zoe!</font>

1451
01:28:41,280 --> 01:28:43,440
<font color="#00ffff">Can't you help us?</font>

1452
01:28:43,440 --> 01:28:46,200
<font color="#ffffff">We obey our creator. That is all</font>
<font color="#ffffff">that can be expected</font>

1453
01:28:46,200 --> 01:28:49,120
<font color="#ffffff">of any character, unless the Master</font>
<font color="#ffffff">says otherwise.</font>

1454
01:28:53,440 --> 01:28:56,560
<font color="#00ff00">And now, Doctor, obey me.</font>

1455
01:28:56,560 --> 01:28:58,080
<font color="#ffffff">No!</font>

1456
01:28:58,080 --> 01:29:02,760
<font color="#ffffff">Suddenly the Karkus</font>
<font color="#ffffff">came to their rescue.</font>

1457
01:29:05,160 --> 01:29:08,400
<font color="#ffff00">I am at your command.</font>

1458
01:29:08,400 --> 01:29:11,640
<font color="#ffffff">He raised his anti-molecular</font>
<font color="#ffffff">disintegrator gun</font>

1459
01:29:11,640 --> 01:29:13,400
<font color="#ffffff">and destroyed the soldiers.</font>

1460
01:29:18,480 --> 01:29:22,880
<font color="#00ff00">No! But the Karkus realised his</font>
<font color="#00ff00">mistake,</font>

1461
01:29:22,880 --> 01:29:26,520
<font color="#00ff00">and turned back to face his real</font>
<font color="#00ff00">enemies, Jamie and Zoe.</font>

1462
01:29:30,120 --> 01:29:32,560
<font color="#ffff00">What's he doing? Duck, Zoe!</font>

1463
01:29:34,280 --> 01:29:37,360
<font color="#00ff00">With Jamie and Zoe firmly in his</font>
<font color="#00ff00">sights,</font>

1464
01:29:37,360 --> 01:29:40,360
<font color="#00ff00">the Karkus pressed the trigger</font>
<font color="#00ff00">of his gun.</font>

1465
01:29:41,600 --> 01:29:46,800
<font color="#ffffff">But all the power had been used up</font>
<font color="#ffffff">on the soldiers and it was useless.</font>

1466
01:29:46,800 --> 01:29:49,160
<font color="#ffffff">Ooh, you'll have to do better than</font>
<font color="#ffffff">that!</font>

1467
01:29:49,160 --> 01:29:51,880
<font color="#00ff00">Suddenly, a swashbuckling figure</font>
<font color="#00ff00">appeared.</font>

1468
01:29:51,880 --> 01:29:57,400
<font color="#00ff00">Poet and swordsman,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">the famous Cyrano de Bergerac.</font>

1469
01:29:57,400 --> 01:30:00,920
<font color="#00ff00">Remorselessly, Cyrano advanced</font>
<font color="#00ff00">on those</font>

1470
01:30:00,920 --> 01:30:04,000
<font color="#00ff00">who had dared to poke fun</font>
<font color="#00ff00">at his nose.</font>

1471
01:30:04,000 --> 01:30:05,360
<font color="#ffffff">But wait.</font>

1472
01:30:06,360 --> 01:30:10,960
<font color="#ffffff">He found himself face-to-face</font>
<font color="#ffffff">with the fearless musketeer</font>

1473
01:30:10,960 --> 01:30:13,240
<font color="#ffffff">and fearless swordsman, D'Artagnan.</font>

1474
01:30:27,520 --> 01:30:30,280
<font color="#ffffff">Jamie, Zoe, get away from there!</font>

1475
01:30:40,520 --> 01:30:42,320
<font color="#ffff00">Come on, Zoe.</font>

1476
01:30:44,440 --> 01:30:47,440
<font color="#ffff00">Princess Rapunzel, can we use</font>
<font color="#ffff00">your hair again?</font><font color="#00ff00"> Of course.</font>

1477
01:30:47,440 --> 01:30:50,080
<font color="#00ffff">Why are we going down there?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">We've got to find the Doctor.</font>

1478
01:30:51,160 --> 01:30:56,040
<font color="#00ff00">Stop them. Substitute cutlass for</font>
<font color="#00ff00">rapier. Cancel Cyrano.</font>

1479
01:30:56,040 --> 01:30:58,760
<font color="#00ff00">Blackbeard the Pirate.</font>

1480
01:30:58,760 --> 01:31:00,640
<font color="#00ff00">Cancel D'Artagnan.</font>

1481
01:31:00,640 --> 01:31:03,920
<font color="#00ff00">Substitute Sir Lancelot</font>
<font color="#00ff00">in full armour.</font>

1482
01:31:12,360 --> 01:31:13,440
<font color="#ffff00">This way.</font>

1483
01:31:15,880 --> 01:31:21,600
<font color="#00ff00">The Doctor is expendable.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Expendable. He will be destroyed.</font>

1484
01:31:23,480 --> 01:31:27,200
<font color="#00ff00">Oh, no, no. He's the only person.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">There's nobody else.</font>

1485
01:31:27,200 --> 01:31:29,880
<font color="#00ff00">I can't go on for ever.</font>

1486
01:31:29,880 --> 01:31:34,240
<font color="#00ff00">Please give me another chance.</font>

1487
01:31:34,240 --> 01:31:36,040
<font color="#00ff00">You have failed.</font>

1488
01:31:36,040 --> 01:31:40,560
<font color="#00ff00">The Master Brain must be protected</font>
<font color="#00ff00">against overloading.</font>

1489
01:31:41,720 --> 01:31:44,400
<font color="#00ff00">Robot force will deal with him.</font>

1490
01:31:48,600 --> 01:31:52,640
<font color="#00ff00">Change robot weapon</font>
<font color="#00ff00">to destructor beam.</font>

1491
01:31:54,280 --> 01:31:57,200
<font color="#ffffff">BUZZING, WHIRRING</font>

1492
01:32:06,200 --> 01:32:07,440
<font color="#00ff00">Remove him.</font>

1493
01:32:07,440 --> 01:32:09,440
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, my goodness.</font>

1494
01:32:10,800 --> 01:32:15,200
<font color="#ffffff">Uh, as...as the white robots</font>
<font color="#ffffff">advanced on the Doc...</font>

1495
01:32:16,200 --> 01:32:18,800
<font color="#ffffff">No, I can't say that!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I can't say that.</font>

1496
01:32:18,800 --> 01:32:22,640
<font color="#00ff00">No, Doctor.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">You can't save yourself this time.</font>

1497
01:32:23,920 --> 01:32:25,600
<font color="#00ff00">Bring him out.</font>

1498
01:32:25,600 --> 01:32:28,000
<font color="#ffff00">What can we do?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">We can't fight those brutes.</font>

1499
01:32:28,000 --> 01:32:30,200
<font color="#00ffff">No, but the computer</font>

1500
01:32:30,200 --> 01:32:33,040
<font color="#00ffff">must control everything,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">the robots included.</font>

1501
01:32:33,040 --> 01:32:36,720
<font color="#00ffff">The Master said it must be protected</font>
<font color="#00ffff">against overloading.</font>

1502
01:32:40,920 --> 01:32:44,200
<font color="#00ff00">It is a pity that we have to destroy</font>

1503
01:32:44,200 --> 01:32:47,000
<font color="#00ff00">such an intelligent mind as yours,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Doctor,</font>

1504
01:32:47,000 --> 01:32:50,400
<font color="#00ff00">but you leave us no alternative.</font>

1505
01:32:51,600 --> 01:32:53,440
<font color="#00ff00">Disintegrate.</font>

1506
01:32:53,440 --> 01:32:56,320
<font color="#ffffff">SCREECHING, BEEPING, WHIRRING</font>

1507
01:33:03,480 --> 01:33:05,440
<font color="#00ff00">Stop them!</font>

1508
01:33:08,720 --> 01:33:11,240
<font color="#00ff00">They will overload the Master Brain!</font>

1509
01:33:13,920 --> 01:33:16,640
<font color="#00ff00">Destroy them. Destroy!</font>

1510
01:33:24,240 --> 01:33:25,880
<font color="#ffff00">Zoe, duck!</font>

1511
01:33:27,280 --> 01:33:30,080
<font color="#ffffff">BANGING, EXPLOSIONS</font>

1512
01:33:44,920 --> 01:33:47,720
<font color="#ffffff">Zoe? Jamie? Oh, my goodness!</font>

1513
01:33:55,800 --> 01:33:58,920
<font color="#00ffff">Shouldn't we go?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Yes. Jamie, give me a hand.</font>

1514
01:33:58,920 --> 01:34:02,000
<font color="#ffff00">What do you want to bring him for?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Don't argue, Jamie, give me a hand.</font>

1515
01:34:05,920 --> 01:34:09,560
<font color="#ffff00">I don't see why we had to bring him.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">He caused all this trouble.</font>

1516
01:34:09,560 --> 01:34:12,840
<font color="#ffffff">Are you all right, sir?</font>
<font color="#00ff00">I'm not altogether sure where I am.</font>

1517
01:34:12,840 --> 01:34:16,560
<font color="#00ff00">Is this the office</font>
<font color="#00ff00">of the Ensign magazine?</font>

1518
01:34:16,560 --> 01:34:20,360
<font color="#ffffff">You were kidnapped, like we were.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">They've been using your mind.</font>

1519
01:34:20,360 --> 01:34:22,240
<font color="#00ffff">What happens to us now?</font>

1520
01:34:22,240 --> 01:34:24,240
<font color="#ffffff">That depends on the white robots.</font>

1521
01:34:24,240 --> 01:34:26,080
<font color="#ffffff">Their last order was to destroy.</font>

1522
01:34:26,080 --> 01:34:28,720
<font color="#ffffff">Let's hope they're destroying</font>
<font color="#ffffff">one another.</font>

1523
01:34:28,720 --> 01:34:32,360
<font color="#00ffff">What about the Karkus</font>
<font color="#00ffff">and Gulliver and our friends?</font>

1524
01:34:32,360 --> 01:34:35,440
<font color="#ffffff">You can't blow up a fictional</font>
<font color="#ffffff">character.</font>

1525
01:34:35,440 --> 01:34:36,960
<font color="#ffff00">But what about us, though?</font>

1526
01:34:36,960 --> 01:34:39,280
<font color="#ffffff">We'll have to hope the destruction</font>

1527
01:34:39,280 --> 01:34:41,680
<font color="#ffffff">of the computer returns us all to</font>
<font color="#ffffff">reality.</font>

1528
01:34:41,680 --> 01:34:44,960
<font color="#00ff00">Do you mean I'm going home?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I hope so.</font>

1529
01:34:44,960 --> 01:34:48,600
<font color="#00ffff">But it could just as well</font>
<font color="#00ffff">send us into oblivion.</font>

1530
01:34:48,600 --> 01:34:51,120
<font color="#ffff00">Vanish for ever?!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">We shall soon know.</font>

1531
01:34:51,120 --> 01:34:53,520
<font color="#ffffff">Hang on. Here it comes.</font>

1532
01:35:04,480 --> 01:35:06,680
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, that was scary.</font>

1533
01:35:06,680 --> 01:35:10,440
<font color="#ffffff">Those clockwork soldiers gave me</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the shivers.</font>

1534
01:35:10,440 --> 01:35:13,240
<font color="#ffffff">Still, we got away by the skin of</font>
<font color="#ffffff">our teeth.</font>

1535
01:35:13,240 --> 01:35:15,840
<font color="#ffff00">The story of our lives.</font>

1536
01:35:15,840 --> 01:35:18,520
<font color="#ffff00">And you've got a different face.</font>

1537
01:35:18,520 --> 01:35:20,120
<font color="#ffff00">Sorry about that.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Aye.</font>

1538
01:35:20,120 --> 01:35:22,760
<font color="#ffffff">Maybe we should go back there, swap</font>
<font color="#ffffff">this old one for a new one.</font>

1539
01:35:22,760 --> 01:35:26,040
<font color="#ffff00">No chance.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">You look very distinguished.</font>

1540
01:35:26,040 --> 01:35:27,720
<font color="#ffffff">Ah, thank you.</font>

1541
01:35:27,720 --> 01:35:32,080
<font color="#ffffff">Well, who'd have thought, president</font>
<font color="#ffffff">and a Highlander sharing stories.</font>

1542
01:35:32,080 --> 01:35:33,800
<font color="#ffffff">I can get used to this.</font>

1543
01:35:33,800 --> 01:35:37,960
<font color="#ffff00">Well, we can't stay here forever,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Jamie. There's people who need us.</font>

1544
01:35:39,520 --> 01:35:44,120
<font color="#ffffff">But suppose we went back</font>
<font color="#ffffff">and forgot all over again.</font>

1545
01:35:44,120 --> 01:35:50,280
<font color="#ffff00">Well, whatever this place is, it's</font>
<font color="#ffff00">restored our memories, for good.</font>

1546
01:35:51,480 --> 01:35:55,640
<font color="#ffff00">I think all we need to do,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">if we want to come back here,</font>

1547
01:35:55,640 --> 01:35:58,520
<font color="#ffff00">is to close our eyes</font>
<font color="#ffff00">and remember it.</font>

1548
01:35:59,720 --> 01:36:01,360
<font color="#ffffff">Maybe we're in heaven.</font>

1549
01:36:01,360 --> 01:36:03,840
<font color="#ffff00">I hope not. I'm a very busy woman.</font>

1550
01:36:03,840 --> 01:36:10,360
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, so does Madame President</font>
<font color="#ffffff">have time for another story?</font>

1551
01:36:10,360 --> 01:36:13,000
<font color="#ffff00">Go on, then.</font>

1552
01:36:13,000 --> 01:36:14,160
<font color="#ffff00">Ice Warriors.</font>

1553
01:36:14,160 --> 01:36:17,560
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, how can I forget those great</font>
<font color="#ffffff">lumbering lizards?</font>

1554
01:36:17,560 --> 01:36:21,920
<font color="#ffffff">And poor Victoria, screamed her</font>
<font color="#ffffff">lungs out when she first saw them.</font>

1555
01:36:21,920 --> 01:36:24,120
<font color="#ffffff">Nearly brought down a mountain.</font>

1556
01:36:26,400 --> 01:36:29,280
<font color="#ffffff">I wonder if she's still out there</font>
<font color="#ffffff">somewhere?</font>

1557
01:36:29,280 --> 01:36:30,960
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, I bet she is.</font>

1558
01:36:30,960 --> 01:36:34,320
<font color="#ffff00">I wonder if we all come here</font>
<font color="#ffff00">eventually?</font>

1559
01:36:34,320 --> 01:36:36,560
<font color="#ffff00">All the Doctor's friends?</font>

1560
01:36:37,640 --> 01:36:38,920
<font color="#ffffff">I hope she had a nice life.</font>

1561
01:36:40,160 --> 01:36:42,480
<font color="#ffff00">I'm sure she did.</font>

1562
01:36:42,480 --> 01:36:46,160
<font color="#ffff00">I bet she thought of you every</font>
<font color="#ffff00">single day.</font>

1563
01:36:47,960 --> 01:36:50,880
<font color="#ffff00">Because there's one thing I know for</font>
<font color="#ffff00">sure,</font>

1564
01:36:50,880 --> 01:36:56,400
<font color="#ffff00">I will never, ever forget this</font>
<font color="#ffff00">again.</font>

